<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">Pusuana</book>
  <para style="h">Pusuana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Pusuana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Pusuana</para>
  <para style="mt">Pusuana</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Egypt ah a innkuan puite tek le Jacob taw a pai, Jacob tapate sia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Reuben, Simeon, Levi, Judah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Issachar, Zebulun, Benjamin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dan, Naphtali, Gad le Asher ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jacob suan hi mite a vekpi in 70 pha hi. A tapa Joseph sia Egypt ah omkhol zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khua hong ngei vaial ciang Joseph, a suapuite le a khanngual a om laite theampo thi siat hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ahizong amate suan le paal Israel te in ta tam mama nei in pung a, Egypt ngam sungah dimin thahat mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Joseph ii thu a he ngeingawl kumpi thak khat Egypt ngam ah hong khang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in a mite tungah, “Hi Israel te pung mama in, thahat ahiciang ei atu in lauhuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngal om luilam thong le, ei hong sim tu in ih ngalte taw kipawl in, ngamsung pan suakta tha tu hi. Amate hong tam vaial ngawl natu in, ih khaam zawk natu lampi zong tawng,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Egypt te in a thinno thei natu in nasep ham seamsak a, amate tungah sila ukte koi hi. Kumpipa an khol natu in Israel te in Pithom le Rameses khuapite saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahizong Egypt te in Israel te a nenniam vaial ciang, Israel te pung vaial in, ngamsung teng ah kizel seseam hi. Egypt te in Israel te hong kiita hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuaciang nuntak man om ngawl za dongin zawthawk vawt a, sal ngimngate suaksak uh hi. Amate in a inn saknate ah le a lote sungah naseamsakin, hesuak vet ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaciang Egypt kumpipa in Hebrew nupite nausuaksak syama niite ahi, Shiphrah le Puah tungah thu sonpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in, “Hebrew nupite nau na suasak uh ciang, a nau sia pa ahile thatlum vun a; ahizong numei ahile nungtasak vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahizong nausuaksak syamate in Pathian kiita ahikom kumpipa thu ni ngawl hi; amate in panote nungtasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaciang kumpipa in nausuaksak syamate samin thu dongh a, “Banghang hi bang ngamta nu ziam? Banghangin panote nungtasak nu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in, “Hebrew numeite Egypt numeite taw kibang ngawl hi; amate ol takin nausuak a, ko thet ma in a nau suak zo uh hi,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nausuaksak syamate in Pathian kiita ahikom, Pathian amate tungah pha in, amate suan le paal pia in innkuan tek neisak hi. Tuaciang Israel te pung tawto in, thahat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A khakbel ciang kumpipa in a mite theampo thupia a: “Hebrew pano suaktuung theampo la vun a, Nile ngun sungah vawk vun, ahizong numei theampo nungtasak vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hunsung in Levi minamte pasal khat in ama minampui numei khat teenpui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua nu in tapa khat neipui hi. A tasen bangza in pha cisia a nu in a mu ciang tha thum sung a tapa phual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahizong a nu in a tapa a phual zawk nawn ngawl ciangin, pumpa taw kivawt khum khat la in, tui a tum thei ngawl natu in, kattaza taw zut hi. A nu in tuasung ah nauno sialin, ngunhui lopa thukna ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nauno ii suapuinu in a khuala thithimna ah dingin, bang a tat ziam ci in en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa tanu kibual tu in ngun sungah tuak hi, tua laitakin a naseamte ahile ngundung ah vak uh hi. Thakhat thu in ama in lopa thukna ah a om tua khum mu a, a sila numei khat tua khum la tu in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa tanu in tua khum hong a, nausen pano khat mu hi. Tua nauno kakap ahiciang ama in khuangaihuai sa hi. Ama in, “Hi sia Hebrew nausen khat hi ta a,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuasia ciang nauno suapuinu in, “Hi nauno a omh tu in, Hebrew nupi khat kong sam tu ziam?” ci in tua nu dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa tanu in, “Hesuakna taw hong sapsak ta'n,” ci in zo hi. Tuaciang numeino sia pai in nausen ii a nu hong paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpipa tanu in tua nu tungah, “Hi nausen la in a, kei atu in hong opsak ta'n, na thaman kong pia tu hi,” ci hi. Tua ahiciang tua nu in nausen la a, opsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Patang hong khan ciang, a nu in kumpipa tanu kungah paipui a, kumpipa tanu in ama tapa sua hi. Kumpipa tanu in, “Tui sung pan ka laak ahiciang a min Moses ka phuak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moses hong let ciang, a mipui Hebrew te kungah haw in, zawthawk thu taw a kisawl nasep haksa a sepsaknate mu hi. Egypt te khat in Moses ii mipui Hebrew mi khat a thalup ngawngawn mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moses in a kiim a paam enin, ama a en kuama a mu ngawl ciang Egypt mi pa thatlum in a luang sen sungah phual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A zing ciang ama pai kik a, Hebrew te nii kihau mu hi. Ama in a khial pa tungah, “Banghangin na Hebrew mipui sia pa saat ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua pa in, “Kote hong uk tu le thukhen tu in, akua in nang hong koi ziam? Egypt mipa na thalup bangin kei hong that tu ni ziam?” ci in zo hi. Tuasia ciang Moses lau a, “Ka ngamtatna teng ngual in hong mu zo hi ta a maw,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua thupiang teng kumpipa in a zaak ciang Moses thalup tu in zongsak a, ahizong Moses sia Midian ngam ah teang tu in tai hi. Ni khat, Moses tuikhuk khat paam ah a to laitak, Midian thiampi Jethro ii tanu salite tuitoai tu in hong pai uh a, a pa ii tuu le kealte atu in tuikuang teng tui dimh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahizong tuucing pawlkhatte in Jethro tanute notkeak uh hi. Tuaciang Moses in amate suatakin, a ngannote tui piaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate a pa kungah a cia uh ciang, a pa in, “Banghang tuni hong cia pal nu ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in, “Egypt te khat in tuucingte khut sung pan hong suatakin, ko atu in tui ngawngawn hong toaisak a, ih ngannote tui hong piaksak hi,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pa in a ta numeite tungah, “Tua pa koi sungah om ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Banghangin tua pa tualai ah nusia nu ziam? Pai tavun a, eima taw an nekhawm tu in sam tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuabangin tualai ah a teang tu in Moses thukim ahikom, Jethro in a tanu Zipporah taw kiteangsak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zipporah in tapa khat neipui hi. Moses in, “Hi ngam ah ngamdangmi khat suak ka hi ciang, a min Gershom ka phuak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kum tampi zawkciang Egypt kumpipa thi a, ahizong Israel te a saltanna hangin thuumin, tau a, hu ngenin kap lai uh hi. A kaana awte Pathian kung thengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ama in amate taunate a zaak ciang Abraham, Isaac le Jacob taw a thuciamna phawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in Israel te saltanna mu in, amate atu in thinbot hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in Midian thiampi, a sunghpa Jethro ii tuu le kealte cingin a om laitak ni khat ni in a ngannote sennealngam kaantanpui in mual thiangtho Sinai theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualai ah Topa vantunglalang sia sawlpaang khat ii sung pan a pusuak meikuang khat bangin ama kungah kilangh hi. Moses in sawlpaang a kaangh in mu a, ahizong sawlpaang sia kaanghtum ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in, “Hi sia paw lamdang ei! Banghang sawlpaang sia kaanghtum ngawl ziam? Kei pai in, a nai neakin va en tong,” ci in ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses ii a nai a neak vaial Topa in a mu ciang Topa in sawlpaang sung pan, “Moses! Moses!” ci in sam hi. Ama in, “Hi khi hi, keima hilai ah om khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in, “A naizaw in hong neak heak in. Na peangdap suut in, banghang ziam cile mun thiangtho tungah ding ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in na taanghpupite ii Pathian, Abraham, Isaac le Jacob te ii Pathian ka hi hi,” ci hi. Tua ahiciang Moses in a mai hum hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian en ngam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa in, “Egypt ah ka mite bang zata vawtsiatna thuak cisia ka mu zo hi, sila ukte khut sung pan suakta nuam in a kaana aw zongh ka za zo hi. A ngim thuakna theampo ka he siat hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tua ahiciang Egypt te khut sung pan a hun tu le Egypt pan la in lei phana le ngam zaina munah a paipui tu in kong tuaksuk zo hi, tua ngam sia a zai, a hau le leihoi leipha hi a, tu in Canaan mite, Hit mite, Amor mite, Periz mite, Hiv mite le Jebus mite teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka mite kaana aw ka za takpi zo a, Egypt te ii a zawthawk vawtzia zongh ka mu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu in ka mite Egypt ngam pan lam na pui thei natu in, a kumpipa kungah nangma kong puak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahizong Moses in Pathian tungah, “Kei sia bangma ka hi bua hi. Kumpipa kungah pai in Israel te Egypt pan bangbang paipui thei thong tu khi ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian in, “Nang taw kong omkhawm tu a, Egypt pan Israel te na paipui ciang, hi mual tungah nong bia tu hi. Tuasia in nangma hong paisak tatak ka hina, a kilakna hi tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahizong Moses in, “Kei Israel te kungah pai in, ‘Na taanghpupite ii Pathian in note kungah kei hong paisak hi,’ ka ci ciang, ‘Ama min akua ziam’ ci in amate in kei hong dongh tu hi. Tua ahikom bangbang son thei tu khi ziam?” ci kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian in, “Keima sia Keima ka hi hi. Amate tungah hisia na son hamtang tu hi: ‘KEIMA a kici khat in note kungah kei hong paisak hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima, Topa a taanghpupite ii Pathian, Abraham, Isaac le Jacob te ii Pathian in amate kungah nang kong paisak sia Israel te tungah son in. Hi sia in a tawntung ka min hi; maisang hong piang tu khang theampo in hi bangin keima hong sam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pai in a, Israel lampuite kaikhawmin, Keima Topa a taanghpupite ii Pathian, Abraham, Isaac le Jacob te ii Pathian in note mai ah hong kilangh ka hi sia amate tungah son in. Amate kungah ka pai zo a, Egypt te ii amate tungah a vawtna teng ka mu hunlam amate son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nasia tak vawtsiat a thuakna Egypt pan amate ka pusua pui tu a, leihoi leiphana mun — Canaan mite, Hit mite, Amor mite, Periz mite, Hiv mi te le Jebus mite teenna ngam ah amate paipui tu in ka khensat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ka mite in nangma thuson hong ngai tu uh hi. Tua zawkciang Israel lampuite taw Egypt kumpipa kungah pai in a, ama tungah, ‘Hebrew te ii Pathian Topa sia kote tungah ama le ama hong kilaak zo hi. Tu in sennealngam sungah Topa, kote Pathian tungah sangaw biakpiakna ka piak thei natu uh in, kote ni thum sung khual hong hawsak ta'n,” ci tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zawthawk thu taw a kisawl bua nale Egypt kumpipa in note hong paisak ngawl tu cisia ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahizong ka vaangletna zanghin, a lauhuai nate tua munah ka vawtna taw Egypt daan ka pia tu hi. Tua zawkciang ama in note hong paisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ka mite a pai ciang, khut nguak masuan in a pai ngawl natu in Egypt te in note kong upatsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel numei theampo in a innpaam Egypt te le a innkuanpui Egypt numei pawpo kungah pai in nik le puan, khamh le ngunn, suang manphate na ngen tu uh hi. Israel te in tua nate a tapate a tanute in silhsakin, Egypt te hauna teng laaksak siat tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Moses in Topa tungah, “Ahizong Israel te in kei hong um ngawlin ka thuson hong ngai ngawl tu ci tawng. Amate in nang tungah Topa hong kilangh ngawl hi, hong ci thong le bangbang hi tu khi ziam?” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Topa in, “Nang bang toai ni ziam,” ci in dongh hi. Ama in, “Ciangkhut khat toai khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in, “Na ciangkhut lei ah lawn in,” ci hi. Moses in a ciangkhut a lot ciang ngul khat suakin, tua sia kung pan Moses tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in Moses tungah, “Kunsuk in a, a mei pan zamh in,” ci hi. Tuaciang Moses in kunsuk in man a, ciangkhut suak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in, “Amate taanghpupite ii Pathian, Abraham, Isaac le Jacob te ii Pathian nang tungah hong kilangh ahi hunlam sia Israel te ii tel natu in hi bangin vawt in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Na khut na puan sungah koi in,” ci kik hi. Moses in a thu ni hi; a khut a laak kik ciang a khut tungah vuuk bangin a kaangpawl ciptepte in tuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in, “Na khut na puan sungah koi kik in,” ci hi. Moses in koi kikin, a laak kik ciang a pumpi dangte taw kibangin dam kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in, “Amate in nalamdang lakna a khatna sia taw hong um thei buale zong tu a sia taw in nang hong um tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi nalamdang lakna niite taw zongh hong um zo bualai a, na thu hong ngai ngawlin hong nial le, Nile ngun pan tui tawm la in lei ah sung in. Tua tui sia chisan suak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahizong Moses in, “Hi thei bo, Topa awng kei hong sawl heak in. Thu son ka thiam ngei bua a, nangma nong paupui ciil a kipan tu dong thuson ka thiam tuan bua hi, kampau ka thiam bua hi, ka aw tawn in ka pau awk hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Mihingte ii kam le muk akua in pia ziam? Akua in nangong le kampau thei ngawlin vawt ziam? Akua in khua musak a, akua in mittawsak ziam? Tua in Topa Keima ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu in, va pai ta'n! Na kampau kong hu tu a, na thuson tu kong hil tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahizong Moses in, “Hi thei bo, Topa awng, nong hesuakna in midang khat pawpo sawl zaw ta'n,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Moses tungah Topa thin uuk a, “Levi mi, na suapuipa Aaron bangbangziam? Ama pha tak a pau thei sia ka he hi. A tatakin ci leang nang taw kimu tu in, tu in ama hong pai a, nang hong mu tu lawp mama tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama tungah thu son thei tu ni hi, a son tu teng hil in. Na nii in na thuson kong hu tu a, na vawt tu uh teng kong hil khawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama sia nang taang in a paupa hi tu a, mite tungah thuson tu hi. Tuasia ciang nangma Pathian bang na hi tu a, a ci tu teng na son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi ciangkhut keng ta'n; banghang ziam cile tuasia taw nalamdang laknate na vawt tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Moses sia a sunghpa Jethro kungah pai kik in ama tungah, “Egypt ngam ah ka mealheakte a nungta lai ziam maw a vil tu in nong hesuakna in hong ciasak ta'n,” ci hi. Jethro thukim a ciidam in va cia ta'n ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Midian ah Moses a om lai in Topa in, “Egypt ah heak kik ta'n, nang hong that nuamte thi siat zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in a zi le a tapate a laate tungah tosakin Egypt zuan uh hi, Pathian ii a sawl ciangkhut sia keng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Tu in Egypt ah cia kik tu na hi ciang nalamdang lakna theampo a vawt thei tu in vaangletna kong piaksa hi a, kumpipa mai ah vawt tatak tu ni hi. Ahizong kumpipa thin ka sahsak tu a, ama in mihingte paisak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuasia ciang nangma in kumpipa tungah, keima Topa in ‘Israel sia ka tapaciil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima hong biak thei natu in ka tapa paisak in, hong ci khi hi, ahihang nong nial hi. Tu in, na tapaciil thatlum tu khi hi,’ ci in na son tu hi” ci kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Egypt paina lampi, ngiaphual ah Topa in Moses taw kimu in thalup sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuasia ciang a zi Zipporah in suanghiam khat la in a tapa ii vunteap attansak a, tuasia taw Moses ii peang kithuthasak hi. Vunteap at ngeina zeksa hangin a zi in Moses tungah, “Nang sia kei tungah chisan taw kipawl ka pasal hi ni hi!” ci hi. Tua ahikom, Topa in Moses ii nuntakna khoaikhe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua hunsung in Topa in Aaron tungah, “Moses taw kimu tu in, sennealngam sungah pai in,” ci hi. A sawl bangin mual thiangtho ah pai a; Moses taw a kimu ciangin namh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in Egypt ah heakkik in a ci lai a, Topa kam vaithak theampo le Topa ii sep tu in a sawl nalamdang lakna tu thute zongh Aaron tungah son siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses le Aaron Egypt ah paikhawmin Israel lampuite theampo kaikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa ii Moses tungah a thuson teng Aaron in amate tungah son kik siat hi, tua zawkciang Moses in mite mai ah nalamdang lakna theampo vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate in um uh hi. Amate kungah Topa pai in kivawtsiatna a thuaknate Topa ii a mu sakna thu teng a zaak uh ciang amate kunin Topa bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses le Aaron Egypt kumpipa kungah pai in, “ Topa Israel te ii Pathian in, ‘Ka mite sennealngam ah kei zatak piakna poai khat a khaam thei natu in paisak in’ hong ci hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “ Topa sia akua ziam? Banghangin ama thu ngai in Israel te paisak tu khi ziam? Tua Topa ka he bua hi; Israel te ka paisak buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses le Aaron in, “Hebrew te Pathian sia kote tungah ama le ama hong kilangh zo hi. Topa ka Pathian tungah sangaw biakna pia tu in ni thum sung sennealngam ah hong paisak ta'n. Tuabang ka hi bua uh le ama in natna taw ahibuale ngal taw in kote hong thatlum tu hi,” ci in zo kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in Moses le Aaron tungah, “Mipite in a nasep a nusiat natu in na vaihawm uh sia bang na cinopna uh ziam? Naseam tu in hi salte kuansak kik vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Egypt te sangin no tam phazaw zo nu hi. Tu in a nasep tawlngasak nuam nu ziam!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ni ma in kumpipa in sal a uk Egypt te tung le Israel naseam ukte tungah thupia a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Uksuang vawt natu in mihingte tungah taangphaw na piak uh tawlnga vun. Amate paisak in zongtawmsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahizong uksuang nidang a den za ma, khat zongh kiam ngawlin deangsak vun. Amate in a sep khom tu nasep nei ngawl ahikom a Pathian tungah sangaw biakna pia tu in ka paisak natu hong ngen tan viuveu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi mite nasep haksa zaw seamsakin, komlasak vun, tua hile leilot thusonte ngai man ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sal ukte le Israel naseam ukte pai in Israel te tungah, “Kumpipa in taangphaw ka pia nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Noma pai in na mutheina mun pawpo ah zongtawm tavun, ahihang uksuang na den ngeiza uh ma vawt tu nu hi hong ci hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahiciang mite sia Egypt ngamsung theampo ah taangphaw zongin kuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sal ukte in taangphaw a kipiak lai a, uksuang a den ngeiza ma ni sim uksuang a den natu in sawl ngawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Egypt mi sal ukte in nasepna uk tu in a koi Israel naseam ukte saat hi. Amate in “Nidang a uksuang na vawt za uh banghang vawt zo ngawl nu ziam?” ci hamtang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuasia ciang naseam ukte kumpipa kungah pai in, “Kumpipa awng, banghangin kote tungah hi bang hong vawt thong ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Taangphaw hong kipia ngawl hi, ahizong uksuang deang tu ma hong kisawl veve hi! Tu in ko hong kisaat hi. A khial sia na mite hi,” ci in a lungkim ngawlna teng son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Note datham in na seam nuam ngawl nu hi, tua hangin Topa tungah sangaw biakna pia in pai tu hong ngen nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu in na nasepna zuan kik tavun! Taangphaw hong kipia ngawl tu a, ahizong uksuang na den ngeiza ma deang veve tu nu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nidangin na den ngeiza ma ni simin na deang tu uh hi ci thu, naseam ukte in a heak ciang thinngim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate hong pusua ciang, amate a ngak Moses le Aaron taw kimu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in Moses le Aaron tungah, “Na nasepnate uh Topa in hong mu zo hi, kumpipa le a uliante in kote hong ensansak na hi uh kom, daan hong pia tu hi. Kote hong thalup natu in a paulap tu khat a pia na hi uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa sangah Moses kiheak in, “ Topa awng, na mite banghangin vawtsia ni ziam? Banghang hi sungah kei hong paisak ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangma atu thu son tu in kumpipa kung ka pai pan kipan amate vawtsia hi. Tua hi a, nangma in amate hu natu bangma na seam bua hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in Moses tungah, “Tu in kumpipa tungah ka sep tu te na mu tu hi. Ka mite a paisak natu in ka seam nanak tu hi. A tatakin ci leang a leitang pan ka mite a hawlkeak tu in ka sawl nanak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian in Moses tungah, “Keima in Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A Vaanglianbel Pathian in Abraham, Isaac le Jacob tungah ka kilangh a, ahizong Topa ci in ka min thiangtho taw amate ka hesak bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngamdangmite bangin a teenna Canaan ngam sia amate tung piak tu kamciam in amate taw thuciamna zongh ka vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu in Egypt te ii salin a mat Israel te tauna ka za zo a, ka thuciamna ka phawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Israel te tungah, ‘Keima in Topa ka hi hi; Egypt te sal panin note kong hun tu a, kong suaktasak tu hi. A thahat ka khut laamin amate tungah a lauhuai daan ka tungsak tu a, note kong hun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Note keima mihing kong suaksak tu a, keima in note Pathian ka hi tu hi. Egypt saltanna pan kong suataksak ciang na Topa na Pathian ka hina nong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abraham, Isaac le Jacob tungah piak tu in ka ciamsa ngam ah kong paipui tu a; tua ngam sia note neisa tu in kong pia tu hi. Keima in Topa ka hi hi,’ ci in, son ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses in Israel te tungah hi thu teng son a, ahizong amate in nadon ngawl uh hi, banghang ziam cile a sila tanna ah kivawtsia in a thin uh tamhtham zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Egypt kumpipa kungah va pai ta'n a, Israel te na ngamsung pan pusuaksak hamtang in ci ta'n” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahizong Moses in, “Israel te ngawngawn zongh in ka thuson hong ngai ngawl tu ci leang bangbangin kumpipa in hong ngai tu ziam? Kampau thiam ngawl mama pa ka hi hi,” ci kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron tungah: “Egypt ngam pan Israel te pusuana ah lampui tu in noma thu kong piak sia Israel te le Egypt kumpipa tungah son tavun.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jacob taciil Reuben in tapa li nei a: Hanoch, Pallu, Hezron, le Carmi hi a; amate min a putsak bee le phungte ii pianna taanghpupite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Simeon in tapa luk nei a: Jemuel, Jamin, Ohad, Jachin, Zohar le Canaan numei khat taw a tapa Shaul hi; amate min a putsak bee le phungte ii pianna taanghpupite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Levi in tapa thum nei a: Gershon, Kohath le Merari hi; amate min a putsak bee le phungte ii pianna taanghpupite ahi uh hi. Levi sia kum 137 nungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gershon in tapa nii nei in: Libni le Shimei hi a, amate in suan le paal tam mama nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kohath in tapa li nei a: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, le Uzziel ahi uh hi. Kohath kum 133 nungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Merari in tapa nii nei a: Mahli le Mushi ahi hi. Hite sia Levi bee le phungte le a suan a paalte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amram in a pa suapuinu Jochebed teenpui in, Aaron le Moses nei hi. Amram sia kum 137 nungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Izhar in tapa thum nei in: Korah, Nepheg, le Zichri ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Uzziel zongh in tapa thum nei a: Mishael, Elzaphan, le Sithri ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aaron in Amminadab ii tanu, Nahshon ii suapuinu Elisheba teenpui a; Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar le Ithamar nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Korah in tapa thum nei a: Assir, Elkanah le Abiasaph ahi hi; amate Korah bee le phung hong pianna taanghpupite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aaron ii tapa Eleazar in Putiel ii tanute khat teenpui in, Phinehas nei hi. Hite sia innkuan lutangte hi a, Levi minamte ii pianna bee le phungte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aaron le Moses tungah Topa in, “Israel minamte lampui in Egypt pan pusuapui vun,” ci in a sawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate sia Israel te suatak natu in, Egypt kumpipa tungah thusonte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Egypt ngamsung Moses tungah Topa in thu a son lai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />ama in, “Keima in Topa ka hi hi. Kong son theampo Egypt kumpipa tungah son in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahizong Moses in, “Nong heak bangin kampau ka thiam bua hi; banghangin kumpipa in ka thuson hong ngai thong tu ziam?” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Kumpipa mai ah nang, Pathian bangin kong vawt tu a, na suapuipa Aaron in na kamsaang bangin ama paupui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kong thupiak theampo Aaron tungah na son tu a, ama in kumpipa tungah Israel te a ngamsung pan a pusuasak natu in son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahizong kumpipa a thin ka sahsak tu a, Egypt ah a lauhuai na tam mama vawt kaleng awlmawk ngawlin na thuson hong ngai ngawl tu hi. Tuasia ciang Egypt te tungah nasia takin daan ka pia tu a, ka mite ii minamte tua ngam pan ka pusuapui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima in ka khut laam in Egypt te tungah ka thahatna ka lak ciang le Israel te a ngam pan ka pusuapui ciang, Egypt te in Topa ka hina hong he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin Moses le Aaron in seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa tungah a thuson hunin, Moses kum sawmliat pha in, Aaron kum sawmliat le kum thum pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Kumpipa in, hong ki up thei natu in, nalamdang khat hong lak tavun, hong cile, nangma Moses in Aaron tungah a ciangkhut la a sawl in kumpipa mai ah lawnsak lete, tuasia ngul khat suak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses le Aaron kumpipa kungah pai in Topa thupiak bangin seam uh hi. Aaron in kumpipa le a uliante mai ah a ciangkhut lawn a, ngul khat suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuasia ciang kumpipa in a mipilte le mitbum thiamte samin a mitbum thiamna taw a kibangma in vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in a ciangkhutte lawnin ngul suak siat hi. Ahizong Aaron ciangkhut in amate aa teng valh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangbang hikale kumpipa thinsak veve a, Topa cisa bangma in kumpipa in Moses le Aaron thu ngai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in Moses tungah, “Kumpipa thin sah mama a, Israel te paisak tu nial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahiciang zingsang in kumpipa Nile ngun ah a pai ciang, pai in a kimu ta'n. Ngul a suak thei na ciangkhut kengin ngunvaal pan ama ngak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kumpipa tungah, ‘ Topa Hebrew te Pathian in amate ii sennealngam sungah ama a biak thei natu in, a mihingte na paisak natu a son tu in kei hong sawl hi. Ahizong tu dong ciang a thu na ni bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu in kumpipa awng, Topa akua hi cisia ama nasep tu sia taw na mu tu hi Topa in hong ci hi. En in, hi ciangkhut taw nguntui ka saat tu a, nguntui chisan suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngasate thi tu a, nguntui uih mama in Egypt te in tua tui ne thei ngawl tu uh hi,’ ci in, son ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Aaron tungah na ciangkhut la in a, Egypt ngamsung ngunte, a kitotawm tuiluamte le tuicingte theampo tungah na ciangkhut vaan in. Tuite chisan hong suak tu a, ngamsung mun theampo le thingbealte, suangbealte sung ngawngawn ah chisan om tu hi, ci in son in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa thupiak bangin Moses le Aaron te in seam uh hi. Kumpipa le a uliante mai ah Aaron in a ciangkhut laamin nguntui saat a, tui theampo chisan suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngun sungah a om ngasate thi in, ui mama ahikom Egypt te in tua tui ne thei ngawl uh hi. Egypt ngamsung mun theampo chisan om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuasia ciang kumpipa ii mitbum thiamte in a mitbum thiamna uh taw tuabang tatak ma in vawt a, kumpipa sia a thinsak ngei bangma in sak veve hi. Topa cisa bangin kumpipa in Moses le Aaron thu ngai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hi zata in thupiangte ngawngawn zongh kumpipa in awlmawk vet ngawlin a kumpi inn ah heakkik zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Egypt te theampo in tua nguntui ne thei ngawl ahikom ngundung ah a tui neak tu tuikhuk to uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa ii Nile nguntui a saat zawk ni sali pha zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in Moses tungah, “Kumpipa kungah va pai ta'n a, Topa in, ‘Keima hong biak thei natu in ka mite paisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thu nong nial le na ngam sungah ulol dimsakin daan kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nile ngun sungah ulol dimleet tu a, ngun sung pan pusuak in na kumpi inn sung, na lupna inndoi sung, na lupna tung, na uliante le na mite inn sung, tuaciang na meikhuk le na kuangte sung ngawngawn dongah hong zuan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ulolte in nangma tung, na mihingte tung le na uliante theampo tungah hong leangto tu ci hi,’ ci in na son tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Ngun tung, a kitotawm tuiluam tung, tuicingte tungah a ciangkhut vaan in, ulolte pusuaksak in a Egypt ngamsung dimsak in ci in Aaron tungah son ta'n” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Aaron in a ciangkhut tui omna theampo tungah vaan a, ulolte pusuak in ngamsung dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahizong mitbum thiamte zongh in mitbum thiamna zanghin ngam sungah ulolte pusuaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa in Moses le Aaron samin, “Hi ulol teng a laakkeak natu in, Topa tungah thungen vun, Topa tungah sangaw biakna a piak thei natu in, na mite ka paisak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses in kumpipa tungah, “Nang atu in thu kong ngetsak tu ka lungdam hi. Nangma, na uliante le na mite atu thu kong ngetsak tu hun ciangtan in. Tuasia ciang, hi ulolte sia Nile ngun sung simngawl mundang ah om nawn ngawl tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Zing ciangin thu hong ngetsak ta'n,” ci in zo hi. Moses in, “Nong sawl bangin ka seam tu a, tuaciang kote Pathian Topa taw a kibang pathian dang a om ngawl hunlam he tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ulolte sia nangma, na uliante le na mite taw kipeal in Nile ngun sung bek ah om tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moses le Aaron te kumpipa nusia in ama ii kumpipa tung dongah a puak ulolte a laak kik natu in, Moses in Topa tungah thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses ii nget bangin Topa in naseam a, inn sung suumsung le lote sungah a om ulolte thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Egypt te in ulol thite a lom a lom in seng a, ngamsung theampo uihsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa in ulol thite a mu ciang a thinsak kikin Topa ci sa bangma kumpipa in Moses le Aaron thu ngai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Aaron in a ciangkhut taw lei a saat natu sawl in a, tua hile Egypt ngamsung leivui theampo thokaang suak siat tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Aaron in a ciangkhut taw lei saatin, Egypt ngamsung leivui theampo thokaang suak a mihingte le nganhingte tungah dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mitbum thiamte in a mitbum thiamna zanghin thokaang piansak tu hanciam a, ahizong vawt thei ngawl uh hi. Thokaang mun theampo ah hong om hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuaciang mitbum thiamte in kumpipa tungah, “Hi sia in Pathian nasepna hi zo hi!” ci uh hi. Ahizong kumpipa thinsakin, Topa ci bangma kumpipa in Moses le Aaron thu ngai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Ngun ah kumpipa a pai ciang kimu tu in zing ciang zingsang tuungin pai in a, Topa in, ‘Amate in kei hong biak thei natu in ka mite paisak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na kidop natu panin ka thu nong nial le daan kong pia tu a, nangma tung, na uliante tung, le na mite tungah tho honpite kong puak tu hi. Egypt te ii inn te tho taw kidim tu a, lei sia tho honpi taw kituamcip tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahizong ka mite teenna Goshen ngam sia tho om ngawl tu in ka khe tu hi. Keima Topa in hi ngam le lei ah naseam hi ci in nong heak natu in hi bangin ka vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka mite le na mite kilaklaw ah kilamdanna khat ka vawt tu hi. Hi nalamdang lakna sia zing ciang in hong piang tu hi,’ ci in son ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in, kumpipa inn sung le a uliante inn sungah tho honpite puak hi. Tho in Egypt ngamsung buppi lalsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuasia ciang kumpipa in Moses le Aaron samin, “Pai in hi ngam sungah na Pathian sangaw biakpiakna pia vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Moses in, “Tuabang hi tu pha ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile Topa ka Pathian tungah nganhingte taw biakpiakna in Egypt te thin uuksak tu hi. Egypt te mu theina ah hi ngannote taw biakpiakna vawtin amate thin uuk thong le kote suang taw hong deanglum tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama hong thupiak bangin Topa ka Pathian tungah sangaw biakpiakna pia tu in, ni thum khualhaw in sennealngam sungah ka pai uh kul tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “A khuala mama na ah pai bua po le uh te, sennealngam sungah Topa na Pathian bia tu in kong paisak tu hi. Kei atu in thu hong ngetsak tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in, “Ka pusua po ciang, zing ciang tho honpite in nangma, na uliante le na mihingte kung pan a tai siat natu in Topa tungah thu ka ngen tu hi. Ahizong mite ii Topa tungah sangaw biakpiakna a vawt tu khaamin, hong theam kik peuma ngawl tu ni hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Moses in kumpipa kung pan pusuakin Topa tungah thungen hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Moses nget bangin Topa in pia hi. Tho honpite kumpipa, a uliante le a mihingte kung panin khat zongh kikhe ngawlin tai siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahizong hi hun zongh ah kumpipa thin sah veve in, ama in tua mite paisak ngawl leleau hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Kumpipa kungah pai in, Hebrew te ii Pathian Topa in, ‘Kei hong biak thei natu in ka mite paisak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na paisak nuam bua leleau ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />no daan kong pia tu a, na ngannote — siphu, laa, kalaoh, khui, tuu le kealte tungah a lauhuai natna ka tungsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel ngannote le Egypt ngannote kilaklaw ah kilamdanna khat ka vawt tu a, Israel te nganno ngawl teng ka thisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima Topa in, hi teng zing ciang mama in ka seam tu hi hong ci hi,’ va ci ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A sonsa bangin a zing ciangin Topa in naseam a. Egypt te nganno theampo thi siat hi, ahizong, Israel te nganno khat zongh thi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa in bang thupiang ziam ci in dongh a, Israel te nganno khat zongh a thi ngawlna thu teng ama tungah kison hi. Ahizong a thin sah veve a, tua mite paisak tuan ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in Moses le Aaron tungah, “Meikhuk pan khutpham dim vut la vun; kumpipa mai vui sungah Moses in tua vutte lawn tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuate Egypt ngamsung theampo ah leivui bangin kithethaang tu a, a thetna mun po ah uilut meima piangsak in, mite le nganhingte uilut veeisak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahiciang amate in vut tawm la in kumpipa mai ah ding uh hi; Moses in tua vutte vui sungah lawnin tua vutte in mihingte le nganhingte tungah uilut meima piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mitbum thiamte Moses mai ah kilaak thei ngawl uh hi, banghang ziam cile a dang Egypt te theampo taw kibangin uilut meima veei siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahizong Topa in kumpipa thin sahsakin, Topa cisa bangma kumpipa in Moses le Aaron thu ngai nuam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in Moses tungah, “Zing ciang zingtuung in kumpipa taw kimu in a, Hebrew te Pathian Topa in, ‘Kei hong biak thei natu in ka mite paisak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leitung theampo ah keima taw kibang khat beak a om ngawl hunlam na heak natu in tu tungin na uliante le na mihingte bek daan pia ngawlin nangma zongh daan kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangma le na mite tungah ka khut laamin natna hong tungsak leng note na mong siat tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahizong leitung bup ah ka minthanna a kizel natu in nang tungah ka vaangletna hong lak nuam in kong nungtasak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahizong nangma na kisathei veve a, ka mite na paisak bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zing ciang, tu hunin Egypt ngam taanghthu sungah a kihe ngeingawl, vui le ngial kithua a nasia mama khat ka piangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu in na ngannote le nadang tuatuam a pua sangah na nei theampo kidalna buk sungah a koi natu in thupia in. A pua sangah a om lai kidalna nei ngawl mihingte le ngannote tungah ngial kia tu a, amate thi siat tu hi,’ ci in va son ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa thusonte hangin kumpipa ulian kimkhatte lau in a silate le a ngannote kidalna buk sungah paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahizong pawlkhatte in Topa thupiakte awlmawk ngawlin, a silate le a ngannote doipua sangah nusia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in Moses tungah, “Na khut van ah laamto in tua hile Egypt ngamsung buppi — mihing, nganhing le lo sung ankung theampo tungah ngial kia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses in a ciangkhut van ah laamto a, Topa in vantosak, ngial kiasakin khualengsak hi. Topa in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />a tee vazal kawkoai khualeng taw a kithua vuipi le ngial kithua nasia mama khat piangsak hi. Tua in Egypt te taanghthu sungah a heak ngei sung pan a nasiabel vuipi suangval ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Egypt ngamsung theampo doipua sangah a om mihingte theampo le nganhingte theampo ngial in deangcip hi. Lo sung ankung theampo puksakin, thingkung theampo talsak siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel te teenna Goshen ngam bekma ngial kia ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa in Moses le Aaron samin, “Tutungin keima maw khi hi; Topa maan a, ka mite le keima khial khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa tungah thungen vun! Hi vanto le ngialkiate kicing zo hi. Note paisak tu in kamciam kong pia a; hi lai ah no om tu kul nawn ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in ama tungah, “Khuapi pan ka pusua po ciang ka khutte laamin Topa tungah thu ka ngen tu hi. Vanto nawn ngawl tu a, ngialkia nawn ngawl tu hi. Tuasia ciang hi leitung sia Topa aa hi ci in na he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahizong nangma le na uliante in Topa Pathian na kiitak ngawl lai uh sia ka he hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngial in anthul le mangtaangte lalsak siat hi, banghang ziam cile mangtaang a min laitak hi in, anthul sia a mom laitak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahizong zungtaang a lal om ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile tuate min ngawl lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kumpipa kung pan Moses khuapi pua sangah pai in a khutte laamin Topa tungah thungen hi. Vanto le ngialkia tawlnga in nguazu nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kumpipa sia thupiang teng a mu ciang khial kik leleau hi. Ama le a uliante thin a sak ngei in sak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungtawnin a sonkhol bangma in kumpipa in Israel te paisak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in Moses tungah, “Kumpipa kungah pai in a, va kimu ta'n. Hi bangin amate sungah nalamdang laknate ka vawt thei natu in ahizong
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nalamdang ka lak ciang, Egypt te a mawmaw bang ka sua sakna thute, na tu na tate tungah na son thei natu ahizong ama le a uliante thin ka sahsak hi. Note theampo in Topa ka hina nong he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tua ahiciang kumpipa kungah Moses le Aaron pai in, “ Topa, Hebrew te ii Pathian in, ‘Kei tungah nong kiniamkhiak tu, bang tanvei hong nial lai tu ni ziam? Kei hong biak thei natu in, ka mite paisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nong nial lai le, zing ciangin na ngam sungah khaumaw kong puak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khaumawte tam mama tu a, lei maitang teng siincip tu hi. Ngial ii a lalsak ngawl, thingkung a taanglaite ngawngawn tuate in netum siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuate sia na kumpi innte, na uliante le na mihingte inn teng theampo dim tu hi. Tuate sia na taanghpupite mu ngeite sangin sia zaw tu hi,’ hong ci hi” ci uh hi. Tua zawkciang Moses kiheak in paisan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa uliante in kumpipa tungah, “Bang tanvei hisia pa in eite ngimna hong pia tu ziam? Topa a Pathian a biak thei natu in, Israel mite paisak in. Egypt ngam lal zo ci sia tel ngawl ni ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses le Aaron kumpipa kungah kipaipui kikin kumpipa in amate tungah, “Note pai in, na Topa Pathian uh bia thei tu nu hi. Ahizong akua teng tatak pai tu nu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses in, “Koma patangte le khanghaamte zongh pai siat tu khu hi. Kote in ka tapate le tanute, ka tuute le kealte, le ka khuite keng tu khu hi, banghang ziam cile Topa zatak piakna in poai khat vawt tu kul hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Na numeite le patangte kong paisak ngeingawl tu sia Topa min taw ka kiciam hi! Note in kei leedo nong sawm uh hunlam kician hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suak thei ngawl hi! Na deina uh tuabang ahile pasal teng bek pai in Topa bia thei nu hi,” ci hi. Tua teng taw Moses le Aaron, kumpipa kung pan kihawlkeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in Moses tungah, “Khaumawte hong kipuak natu in, Egypt ngam le lei tungah na khut laamto in. Tuate hong pai tu a, thingkung po theampo le ngial ii lalsak mong theampo netum tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses in a ciangkhut laamto a, Topa in nisuana sang pan sun le zan tawntung ngamsung vui vasak hi. Tuasia in a zingsang ciang khaumawte hong puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khaumawte a hon a hon in hong theng a, Egypt ngamsung bup ah teang hi. Tua in a kimu ngeingawl le a kimu kik ngeingawl tu khaumaw hon tambel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuate in lei maitang vom mitmet in siin siat hi; ngial ii den mong theampo le thingkung tung thingnga theampo ne siat hi. Egypt ngamsung theampo ah thingkung le ankung tungah a hing khat zongh taang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuasia ciang kumpipa in manlang takin Moses le Aaron samin, “ Topa na Pathian le note tungah ka maw zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu in, khatvei ka mawna hong maisak tavun a, hi a nasia daan piakna kei tung pan a laak keak natu in, Topa na Pathian tungah thu hong ngetsak tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Moses in kumpipa nusia in Topa tungah thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in nisuana sang vui sia, a hat mama nitumna sang hui suaksak a, tua vui in khaumawte lento in Suez Tuidok sungah muutkeak hi. Egypt ngamsung theampo ah khaumaw khat zongh om nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahizong Topa in kumpipa thin sahsakin ama in Israel te paisak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in Moses tungah, “Van ah na khut laamto in, tuaciang a saa mama hunlam a kiphawk tham liang khuazing taw Egypt ngam hong kituam siat tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Moses in a khut van ah laamto in, Egypt ngamsung theampo ni thum sung khuazing bikbek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Egypt te khat le khat kimu thei ngawl a, tua hun sung kuama pusuak ngawl hi. Ahizong Israel te teenna munah khuavak nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kumpipa in Moses samin, “Note pai in, Topa bia thei nu hi; numeite le patangte zongh keng tavun. Ahizong na tuu na keal le na khuite hi lai ah nusia tu nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moses in, “Tuabang ahile Topa ka Pathian tungah meihal biakpiak natu le sangaw biakpiak natu ngannote nong sik kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi ngawl hi, ka ngannote paipui tu khu hi; khat zongh kinusia ngawl tu hi. Topa ka Pathian sangaw biakpiak natu in ngannote koma ii teal kul hi. A mun ka thet mateng, a bang nganno taw ama bia tu cisia ka he buatu uh hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa in kumpipa thin sahsak a, amate paisak nuam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpipa in Moses tungah, “Ka muna ah om heak in! Nang hong musak kik nawn heak in! Kong mu kik ni in thi tu ni hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in, “Nangma maan ni hi. Kei nong mu kik ngei nawn buatu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in Moses tungah, “Egypt kumpipa le a mihingte tungah khatvei bek daan ka pia lai tu hi. Tua zawkciang note hong paisak tu hi. A tatakin ci leang ama in, hi lai pan note theampo hong hawlkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu in Israel mite theampo in a innpaamte tungah khamh le ngunn suangmanphate a nget natu in son ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in Israel te sia Egypt te in zaktasak hi. Uliante le mihingte theampo in Moses sia mi thupi mama khatin ngaisun takpi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in kumpipa tungah, “ Topa in, ‘Zankim hun khawngin Egypt ngamsung teng ah ka pai tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Egypt te tapaciil theampo, kumpi tokhum a lua tu, kumpipa tapa a kipan an ngoaina ah naseam sila numei ii tapa dongin thi tu hi. Nganhing a no suakciil theampo zongh thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nidangin a om ngeingawl le mai sangah a om kik ngei nawn ngawl tu kaana awnging Egypt ngamsung theampo ah om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahizong Israel te ahibuale, a ngannote ahile ui ngawngawn in nak ngawl tu hi. Tuasia ciang Keima Topa ii Egypt te le Israel te kilaklaw ah kilamdanna khat ka vawt na he tu uh hi, hong ci hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moses ii a thukhupna panin, “Na ulian theampo hong pai tu a, ka mai ah kunin ka mite theampo ka paipui natu in hong thuum tu hi. Tua zawkciang ka pai tu hi,” ci hi. Tuaciang Moses thin uuk mama in kumpipa nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Egypt ngam sungah nalamdang lakna tamzaw ka vawt thei lai natu in kumpipa in na thu hong ngai ngawl veve tu hi,” a ci sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moses le Aaron in kumpipa mai ah nalamdang hi zata lak zo hikale, Topa in a thin sahsak ahikom, a ngam sia Israel te in nusiasak nuam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Egypt ngam sungah Topa in Moses le Aaron tung a cina ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tu tha sia note atu in kum kipat tha hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mi bup tungah hi bang kihilna te son tu ni hi: Tu tha ni sawm ni in pasal sim in tuuno khat ahibuale kealno khat a innkuan atu in teal nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nganno pum bup khat a ne tu in a innkuan a tawm leih le, mihing khat ii neak zawkza taw kizui in mihing phaza en in a innpaamte hawm thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nganno sia kum khat a pha, a talno na teal thei tu a, ahihang a mealhem ngawl tuu ahibuale keal hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaciang tua tha ni sawm le ni li nitak ciang Israel mi bup in tua ngante ngo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mipite in a chisan pawlkhat la in, tua sa a kineak natu inn kongkha khuamte nii le a vathaang tungah noai tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zanin a sa na em tu uh a, tol saw ngawl anluum le a kha meeteete taw na ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A sate a sial ahizong tuihuan ahizong na ne buatu uh a, a lu, a peangte le a sungkua dong takin a vekpi em in ne tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zingsang dongin neakmong peuma na omsak buatu uh hi; neakmong a om le na hal kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi ante manlang takin na ne tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile khualhaw tu in peangdapte thua in, na khut sungah ciangkhut toai a, na kithoai uh kul tu hi. Tua in keima Topa tungah zatak piakna Paisan Poai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tua zanin Egypt ngamsung tengah ka pai tu a, mihing le nganhing te ii tapaciil teng thatin, Egypt pathian theampo daan ka pia tu hi. Keima in Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kongkha khuamte tungah chisan a kinoai teng noma teenna inn teptee natu lim ahi hi. Chisan ka mu ciang note kong kaantan tu a, Egypt te daan ka piak ciang note bangma kong law buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima Topa in bang vawt khi ziam ci na phaw natu in hi ni sia biaknapoai khatin vawt tu nu hi. Mailam hun theampo ah tua poai vawt suak tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in, “Ni sali sung tol kisaw anluum peuma na ne buatu uh hi — tol kisaw ngawl anluum bekma na ne tu uh hi. Ni masa ni in na inn uh pan tol theampo heam tu nu hi, banghang ziam cile tua ni sali hunsung khat po in tol kisaw anluum a ne le, ama keima mi in a kisim nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ni masa ni le ni sali ni in biak kikhopna nei tu nu hi. Tua ni nii sung, na na seam buatu uh a, ahizong an neak tu vawt thei nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi poai bosak ngawl tu nu hi, banghang ziam cile tua ni in na minamte Egypt pan kong pusuapui hi. Mailam hun ah zongh tua ni in poai vawt nanak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tha masabel ni sawm le ni li nitak pan ni kul le ni khat nitak sang dong tol kisaw anluum ne ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni sali sung tol peuma na inn sungah koi ngawl tu nu hi, banghang ziam cile tualmi ahizong, ngamdangmi khat pawpo in tol kisaw anluum a ne le keima mi khat in kingaisun nawn ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Moses in Israel lampui teng samin amate tungah, “Na innkuan tek in Paisan Poai na vawt thei natu in, tuuno khat ahibuale kealno khat tealin ngo vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hyssop sip khat la vun a, kuang sungah a om nganhing chisan sungah papin, na inn kongkha khuamte nii le a vathaang tungah noai vun. Zingsang khuavak mateng inn pan khat zongh pusuak ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Egypt te a that tu in Egypt ngamsung teng ah Topa a pai ciang, kongkha khuamte le a vathaangte tungah a kinoai chisan mu tu a, Thina ii Vantunglalang sia na inn te sungah hong that tu in tumsak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hi zui tu ngeinate nangma le na tate in a tawntung zui tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa ii kamciam hong piakna ngam ah na tum uh ciang hi a zeksa ngeina sia seam hamtang tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na tate in, ‘Hi, a zeksa ngeina sia, bang a khiakna ziam’ ci in hong dok ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘ Topa tungah zatakna in ih piak Paisan Poai sangaw biakpiakna hi, Egypt ah Israel te ii innte hong paisatna hang ahi hi. Ama in Egypt te that a, ahizong eite hong khoaikhe hi,’ na ci tu uh hi,” ci hi. Israel mite in khupdin in bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa ii Moses le Aaron tungah a thupiak bangin amate pai in seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zankim laitak Topa in Egypt ngamsung tapaciil theampo, kumpi tokhum a lua tu kumpipa tapa pan kipan leinuai khuazing sung thongtaakte ii tapate dongin that siat a; nganno suakciil theampo zongh that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua zanin kumpipa, a uliante le a dang Egypt mite theampo khanglo siat hi. Tapa thi ngawl inn khat beak om ngawl ahikom Egypt ngamsung teng ah kaana awnging nasia mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua zan ma in kumpipa in Moses le Aaron samsak in, “Nangma le na Israel mite pusuak tavun! Ka ngam nusia tavun a; nong nget bangin pai in, Topa bia tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na tuu, na keal le na khuite la in pai tavun. Kei atu zongh thupha hong ngetsak tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Egypt te in a ngam manlang tak a nusiat natu in tua mite sawl a; “Na pai bua uh ahile ka thi siat tu uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Israel te in tol saw ngawl anvuite anluum emna bealpeute sungah heangin, puan taw tunin a liangko ah pua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Moses ii a ci bangin Israel te in Egypt te tungah khamh le ngunn kizepna, le puansilhte ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Topa in Israel te sia Egypt te in zaktasak ahikom Israel te nget bangin pia uh hi. Tuabangin Egypt te hauna teng Israel te in paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Israel te a peangin pai a, Rameses pan Sukkoth zuan uh hi. Amate numei le patang kihel ngawl pasal tulzaluk bang pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Midang tam mama le tuu, keal le khui tam mama te zongh amate taw paikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amate in Egypt pan a ken tol saw ngawl anluum em uh hi, banghang ziam cile thakhat thu in amate Egypt pan kihawlkeak ahikom a an neak tu ahizong tol saw anluum ahizong kinging man ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Israel te Egypt ah kum 430 sung teang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kum 430 a bo ni in Topa mite ii minam theampo in Egypt nusia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua zan sia amate Egypt pan pusua pui tu in Topa ii kep ni zan hi a; tua zan sia ma Israel te ii mailam hun theampo ah a kepcing nanak tu zan khat in Topa tungah aap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron tungah, “Hite Paisan Poai ah zui tu ngeinate ahi hi: Ngamdangmite kuama in Paisan Poai an ne thei ngawl tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />ahizong na leisa sila pawpo a vunteap atsak masa po le uhte ne thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A peam pak khat, a kicial naseam khat in ne thei ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />An theampo a kihuanna inn sung bek ah kine tu a; a pua ah kipusua pui ngawl het tu hi. Tuaciang tua nganno ii ngute khat zongh thiaktan heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Israel mi bup in hi poai vawt tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />ahizong vunteap at ngawl sia in ne thei ngawl tu hi. Note sungah hong teang ngamdangmi khat in Topa zatakna Paisan Poai a vawt nuam le amate innkuan sung pan pa peuma vunteap atsak masa tu nu hi. Tuasia ciang Israel mi tualsuak khat taw a kibangin poai sungah kihel thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hi zui tu ngeinate sia ma, Israel mi tualsuakte le note sungah hong teang ngamdangmite a kibangin na zui tu uh ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Topa ii Moses le Aaron tungah a thupiak bangin Israel te theampo in thu ni in, seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tua ni in, Topa in Israel minamte Egypt pan pusuapui hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tapaciil theampo kei tungah aapna hong nei tavun, banghang ziam cile Israel tapaciil theampo le nganno suakciil apa theampo keima aa ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses in a mihingte tungah, “Egypt ngam sal na tanna mun na nusiat ni — tuni phawk tavun. Tu ni sia Topa in ama ii vaangletna taw hong pusua pui ni ahi hi. Tol saw ngawl anluum ne tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tha masabel Abib tha, tu ni in note Egypt nusia nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in na taanghpupite tungah Canaan mite, Hit mite, Amor mite, Hiv mite, le Jebus mite teenna ngam piak tu in ciliap huai takin hong kamciam hi. Tua ngam leihoi leiphana ngam ah hong paipui ciang kum sim tha masabel sungin hi poai vawt nanak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni sali sung tol saw ngawl anluum na ne tu uh a, ni sali ni in Topa tungah upatna poai na vawt tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni sali sung tol kisaw anluum peuma na ne buatu uh a, tol ahizong tol kisaw anluum peuma na ngam sungah a om buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua poai na vawt uh ciang na tapate tungah Topa in Egypt pan note hong paipui ahi hu in hi bangin poai kivawt hi, ci in son tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi ngeina poai vawtna in na khut ah ahibuale na tal tungah na khat a kikhit bangin, tua in Topa thukham hong phawksak tawntung tu hi. Tua in Topa thukham na sin tu le na sim tawntung natu in hong phawksak tu hi. Banghang ziam cile Topa in a vaangletna taw Egypt pan note hong pusuapui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum sim a ciangtan hun a tun simin poai vawt tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“ Topa in na taanghpupite tungah a kamciamsa Canaan ngam ah note hong paipui tu hi. Tua ngam note tungah hong piak ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tapaciil theampo Topa tungah pia nanak tu nu hi. Na ngannote a pa suakciil theampo Topa neisa hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ahizong ama tung pan laa pa a suakciil theampo sia tua taang in tuuno khat piakna taw tan kik tu nu hi. Tua laa na tan kik nuam bua ahile a ngawng thiaktan in. Na tapaciil peuma tan kik tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mailam sangah na tapa in hi bang a ih sepnate bang a khiakna ziam ci in hong dongh le, ‘ Topa in a vaangletna zanghin ih saltanna Egypt pan eite hong paipui hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Egypt kumpipa a thinsakin eite hong paisak nop ngawl ciang Topa in Egypt ngamsung tapaciil theampo le nganhing suakciil a pa theampo thatlum siat hi. Tua ahi hu in tapaciil le nganhing suakciil a pa theampo Topa tungah sangaw biakna in kipia a, ahizong ih tapaciilte sia kitan kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi bang ngeina poai vawtna sia nung thu hong phawksak kik tu in ih khut tungah ahibuale ih tal tungah tepteena a kikhit bang hi tu hi; tua in Egypt pan Topa in a vaangletna taw hong pusuapuina thu hong phawksak tu hi,’ ci in son tu nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Egypt kumpipa in Israel te a paisak lai in, Philistia tuipi hui ah a paito lampi sia lam banbel hikale, Pathian in totpui ngawl hi. Pathian in, “Amate ngal a sim kul tu ci in a mu ciang a thin kikheal a, Egypt ah a heak kik tu ka oai bua hi,” ci in ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua lampi taangin ama in sennealngam kiimkot a, San Tuipi sangah masuan hi. Israel te in ngalsim natu ngalhiamte pua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Joseph in Israel te tungah a sep tu in ciliap huai kamciam a vawtsak bangin, Moses in Joseph ii luang tonpui hi. Joseph in, “Pathian in note hong suatak ciang, hi mun pan ka luang nong pua hamtang tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sukkoth nusia in Israel te dingin, sennealngam mong Etham ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate sun ahizong, zan ahizong a khualhaw thei natu in sun hunin lam a lak tu meeikaai khuam khat taw, zan hunin khuavak a pia tu in meitaang khuam khat taw amate mai ah Topa pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel te mai ah sun hunin meeikaai khuam le zan hunin meitaang khuam om tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel te heak kikin Baal Zephon nai, Migdol le San Tuipi kilaklaw Pi Hahiroth ii mai ah ngiaphual a saatna tu in son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa in Israel te ngam sungah vak kawkoai a, senneal in khakcip in ngaisun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama thin ka sahsak tu a, nang hong del tu hi. Kumpipa le a ngalkaphonpi ka zawna pan pataakna ka nga tu hi. Tuasia ciang Egypt te in Topa ka hina hong he tu uh hi,” ci hi. Israel te a kisawl bangin ngamta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel te a suatakna thu Egypt kumpipa tungah a kison ciang ama le a uliante a thin khealin, “A bang teng seam thong hi ziam? Israel te ih suaktasak zo a, ih sila te ih bosua zo hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa in siphu ngalleang le a ngalkaphonpi kithoaisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in a siphu ngalleang phabel 600 kihel in a leang theampo taw a ngalkapmangte in uksakin kuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa ii a thin a sahsak kumpipa in zawna taw in a pusuak Israel te del hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Egypt ngalkaphonpi in a siphu theampo taw, siphu ngalleangte le a hawlte in Israel te del a, Pi Hahiroth le Baal Zephon nai San Tuipi hui a ngiaphual saatna ah pha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel te in kumpipa le a ngalkaphonpi in a del a mu ciang lau mama a, Topa tungah huna ngen in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in Moses tungah, “Egypt ah thaan om ngawl ziam? Hi lai sennealngam ah a thi tu in nang hong paipui kul ziam? Egypt pan nong pusuapuina, na nasepna sa teng en in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ih pusua ma in, hi bang teng piang tu ci hong son zo hi ngawl khu ziam? Egypt te sal ahi tan tu in ko nguak hong nusia lel ta'n kong ci uh hi. Hi lai sennealngam ah thi sangin tua munah sila hi tu phazaw lai hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses in, “Lau heak vun! Kip takin ding vun a, tu ni in Topa hong hutna mu tu nu hi; hi Egypt te mu kik ngeingawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in no atu ngal hong simsak tu a, note sep tu bangma kisam ngawl hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Banghangin huna dei in au nu ziam? Israel te maisang a pai natu in sawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na ciangkhut laamin, tuipi tungah vaan in. Tui hong kikhen tu a, Israel te leiko tung tawnin paisuak thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Egypt te thin ka sahsak mama tu a, Israel te del veve tu uh hi, tuaciang kumpipa, a ngalkaphonpi, a siphu ngalleangte le a hawlte ka zawna taw patoaina ka nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate ka zaw ciang Egypt te in keima Topa ka hina hong he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel ngalkaphonpi mai ah a om Pathian vantunglalang sia kikhiin in nungsangah pai hi. Meeikaai khuam zongh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Egypt te le Israel te kilaklaw dong hong kikhiin hi. Meei in Egypt te atu in khuazingsak a, Israel mite atu in khuavaksak ahikom zankhuateakin ngalkaphonpite khat le khat kineak thei ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Moses in tuipi tungah a khut a vaan ciang, Topa in nisuana sang pan vui thahat khat taw tuipi kinilsak hi. Tua vui sia zankhuateak va in, tuipi leiko suaksak hi. Tui kikhen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel te in leiko tung tawnin tuipi kaantan a, a lang le a lang ah tui pangte hong om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Egypt te in a siphu theampo, a siphu ngalleangte le a hawlte taw tuipi sung dongin del uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in khuavak mahiat in meitaang le meeikaai khuam tung pan Egypt te ensuk in, patausak ek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in a ngalleang muite awksak ahikom haksa takin kikhiin hi. Egypt te in, “ Topa in Israel te sang pangin eite hong do hi. Hi lai pan tai tawng,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Tuipi tungah na khut vaan in, tua hile Egypt te le a siphu ngalleangte le a hawlte tungah tui hong kinil kik tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses in tuipi tungah a khut vaan a, khuavak ciang tui hong heak kikin a ngeina bangin om hi. Egypt te in a suatak natu hanciam a, ahizong Topa in tuipi sungah amate lawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tui heak kikin tuipi sung dongah Israel te a del Egypt ngalkap theampo, a siphu ngalleangte le a hawlte khuum hi; khat zongh kikhe ngawlin khuum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahizong tuipi kaantan in leiko tungah Israel te pai uh a, a lang le a lang ah tuipangte om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ni in Topa in Egypt te khut sung pan Israel mite hun a, tuipivaal ah a thite Israel te in mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Vaangletna lianpi taw Topa in Egypt te a zawna thu Israel te in a mu uh ciang amate in Topa lamdang sa a; Topa le a naseampa Moses muanna nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses le Israel te in hi la Topa tungah sak uh hi: “Ama in a minthang ngalzawna khat nga ahikom, Topa tungah la ka sa tu hi; ama in siphute le a tung tote tuipi sungah lawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa sia a thahat hong dalpa hi a; Ama in kei hong hunpa hi. Ama in ka Pathian hi a, ka pok tu hi, ka pa ii Pathian hi a, ama ii letna thu la in ka sa tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa sia ngalhangpa hi a; ama min Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ama in Egypt ngalkaphonpi le a siphu ngalleangte tuipi sungah lawn hi; a phabel a ulian teng San Tuipi sung tuitaasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi thuk in amate khuum hi; tuipi taw ah suangtum bangin tumsuk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“ Topa awng na khut ziatsang, thahat in lamdang a; tua khut in ngalte semtham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tuanngen na ngualzawna taw na ngalte na lawn thal hi; na thin uukna a kuan ciang taangphaw bangin amate kaanghtum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuipi tungah na hu na muut ciang, a sang in tui kiciangto hi; tuasia pang khat bangin dingtang hi; tuipi a thukbelna mun sia leitang ko suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ngalpa in, “Amate ka del tu a, ka pha tu hi; a hauna teng ka hawm tu a, ka dei theampo ka la tu hi; Ka namsau ka dok tu a, a nei theampo ka la tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahizong khatvei na husan taw Topa awng, Egypt te tuita siat hi; A kiitakhuai tui sungah haak khiak bangin amate tumsuk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“ Topa awng, pathiante sung pan akua in nang taw kibang ziam? Nang taw a kibang, a thiangtho, a lamdang akua om ziam? Akua in nangma aa bangin nalamdang laknate le a nasia sepnate seam thei ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ziatsang khut na vaan a, leitang in ih ngalte valhlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kamciam bangin na thumaan a, na suatak sa mite lam na pui hi; na thahatna taw na ngam thiangtho ah amate lam na pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Minamte in za zo a, amate lau in liing uh hi; Philistia mite lau in patau mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Edom lampuite lau mama uh a; Moab mi thahat te liing uh hi; Canaan mite in a thinhanna teng bosua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Launa le patauna amate tungah theng hi; Topa awng, amate in na thahatna mu uh hi, saltanna pan na suatak na mite ii a kaantan zawk mateng amate launa taw cimaw in ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangma in amate paipui in na mual tungah na omsak hi, Topa awng, tua mun sia nangma tatak ii na saksa Biakinnpi, na inn atu in na tealna mun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma sia a tawntung le a tawntungin kumpi na hi tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel te leiko tawn in tuipi kaantan hi. Ahizong Egypt siphu ngalleangte, siphute le a hawlte taw tuipi sungah a pai ciang, Topa in tui kingawm kiksak in, amate khuumcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aaron suapuinu, kamsaang Miriam in a daalkual khuangno la in, numei theampo in a nung zui uh a, daalkual khuangnote tumin laam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Miriam in amate lasak hi: “ Topa tungah lasa vun banghang ziam cile, Ama in a minthang zawna khat zo zo hi; Ama in siphute le a tung tote tuipi sungah lawn zo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in Israel mite San Tuipi pan Shur sennealngam ah paipui hi. Ni thum sung sennealngam sungah pai a, ahizong tui mu ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaciang amate Marah kicina munah pai a, ahizong tua munah tui khaa mama ahikom tui ne thei ngawl uh hi. Tua ahikom tua mun sia Marah kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mipite in Moses phunsan in, “Bang tui ne tu khu ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moses in thinsung tak taw, Topa tungah thungen hi, Topa in thingbek khat lak a, tua thingbek tui sungah a lot ciang tua tui neakthei suak hi. Topa in tua munah a nuntakpui tu thukhamte pia in, amate ze et si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in, “Keima ii maan ka sak sia na vawtna uh taw ka thu nong ni siat uh a, ka thupiakte na zui uh le Egypt te tungah ka tunsak natnate khat zongh kong tungsak buatu hi. Keima in Topa note hong damsakpa “Jehovah Rapha” ka hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin amate sia ciktui sawm le nii le palm kung sawmsali a omna mun Elim theng a; tua mun tui hui ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi buppi Elim pan ding kik a, Egypt pan a pusua zawk a tha niina, ni sawm le ni nga ni in Elim le Sinai kilaklaw Sin sennealngam theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua sennealngam ah amate theampo in Moses le Aaron phunsan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />amate tungah, “ Topa in Egypt ah hong that le uuk zaw ung. Tualai ah thildang a vaal lai, to in sa le an ka du za ka ne thei tu uh hi. Ahizong noma in hi lai sennealngam ah a pukthi tu in hong paipui nu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Tu in note theampo atu van pan an, ngua bangin kong zusak tu hi. Mihingte ni sim pusuak nanak in tua ni a khamkhop tu tawm tu hi. Tuabangin, kong sonnate a zui ziam, ka sit thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni luk ni in, na top ngeiza ii a zaa nii kaikhawm tu in kinging vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses le Aaron in Israel te theampo tungah, “Egypt pan hong pusuapuipa sia Topa a hina, tu nitakin he tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zingsang ciangin Topa ii ompuina khuavak taang velvol mu tu nu hi. Ama langpanin noma phutsatna thu hong za zo hi — hi hi, ama langpan nu hi, banghang ziam cile kote in ama hong sawlna teng a seam suak ka hi bek uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moses in, “Noma phutsatna teng ama in hong za zo ahikom, nitakin na neak tu uh sa le zingsangin anluum na deiza po hong pia tu sia Topa ahi hi. Ko nong phutsat uh ciang Topa a phunsan hi nginge nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses in Aaron tungah, “ Topa in amate phutsatna za zo ahikom taangpi bup hong pai in Topa mai ah a din natu in son ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aaron in taangpi bup tungah thu a son ciang amate sennealngam sang nga in, thakhat thu in meei sung pan Topa ii khuavak taang velvol hong taang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Israel te hong phutsatna ka za zo hi. Khuangial ciang a neak tu sa a nga natu, zingsang ciang anluum a deiza a nga natu son in. Tuasia ciang Keima sia Topa , amate ii Pathian ka hina thu he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nitak ciangin ngiaphual a dim tu vamim honpui khat hong leangin, zingsang in ngiaphual kiimkot ah daaitui kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Daaitui a ko ciang senneal tungah a khalno bang veu om hi. Tua in nip a, vuuk taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel te in tuasia a mu ciang he ngawl ahikom khat le khat kidongh in “Hisia bangziam?” ci uh hi. Moses in amate tungah, “Hisia in Topa ii note neak tu in hong piak an ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in noma kisap za tek, innkuan sungah mihing sim litre 2 tek na top tu in thu hong pia zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel te in tuabang vawt a, pawlkhat in a tamzaw tawmin, pawlkhat in a tawmzaw tawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in a tee uh ciang tam a tawmte tam leih ngawlin, tawm zaw a tawmte tawm leih tuan ngawl hi. Amate ii kisap za lian tek tawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Moses in amate tungah, “Kuama in zing ciang atu bangma koikhol ngawl tu nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahizong pawlkhat in Moses thu ngai ngawlin pawlkhat koikhol uh hi. A zing ciang tuasia thanh dimin muat nam a, amate tungah Moses thin uuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zing simin a kisap za tek tawm a, ni hong sat ciang lei ah a nusiatte tuitham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni luk ni in an a zaa nii in a tamzaw tawmin, mihing khat ciang litre 4 tek tawm uh hi. Taangpi lampuite theampo hong pai in tua thu Moses tungah son uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Moses in amate tungah, “ Topa in zing ciang sia ama tungah a ki aap tawlngakna ni thiangtho ni khat hi, ci in thu hong pia hi. Tuni in na em nop teng le na huan nop teng em in huan tavun. A taanglai teng peuma zing ciang atu in koituam vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses ii thupiak bangin a om lai teng zing ciang dongin keam a; lal ngawl, a sungah thanh tu ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moses in, “Hite tuni in ne vun, banghang ziam cile tuni sia Sabbath hi a, Topa tungah a ki aap tawlngakna ni khat hi in, ngiaphual pua sangah an bangma mu ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ni luk sung an na tawm nanak tu uh a, ahizong ni sali ni, tawlngak ni in bangma om ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ni sali ni in mihing pawlkhatte in an a tawm tu in pusuak a, ahizong bangma mu ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in Moses tungah, “Banghun dong ka thupiakte note in hong nial lai tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tawlngak ni hong pia pa sia keima Topa ka hina phawk tavun a, tua ahi hu in ni nii sung na khom tu uh an, ni luk ni in kong pia tawntung tu hi. Ni sali ni in a kuama po a omna munah om tu a, inn pan pusuak ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ahiciang mite in ni sali ni in naseam ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel mite in tua an sia manna ci uh hi. Tua manna sia ancii kaang no khat taw kibangin, khuaitui taw kivawt moh bangin lim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Moses in, “Ama ii Egypt pan eite hong paipui ciangin sennealngam ah eite neak tu hong piak an sia ih suan ih paalte in a mu thei natu in manna pawlkhat amate atu na keam tuam tu uh hi, ci in Topa in thu hong pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Moses in Aaron tungah, “Beal khat la in, tua ii sungah manna litre 2 dim koi in a, ih suan ih paalte atu in Topa ompuina ah koi ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah a thupiak bangin tuasia a kikepcing natu in Aaron in Thuciamna Thingkuang mai ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Israel te in a teenna mun Canaan ngam a thet mateng kum sawmli sung manna an ne uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />(Tua hun lai, na ko teena in a zak sia litre 20 taw kikim hi.)
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi bup in Sin sennealngam nusia in Topa thupiak bangin mun khat pan mun khat ah kikhiin uh hi. Rephidim ah ngiaphual saat a, ahizong tua munah neak tu tui om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in Moses tungah, “Neak tu tui hong pia ta'n,” ci in phun uh hi. Moses in, “Banghangin hong phunsan nu ziam? Banghangin Topa ze et nu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahizong a mihingte dangko mama ahikom Moses tungah phuul veve uh hi. Amate in, “Banghang Egypt pan hong paipui ni ziam? Kote ka tate le ka ngannote dangko in hong thisak nuam ni ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses in nasia takin Topa tungah thungen in, “Hi mihingte bang law tu khi ziam? Suang taw hong deang dektak zo uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Israel lampuite pawlkhat samin a, mipite mai ah paikhol vun. Nile ngun na saatna ciangkhut keng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na mai Sinai Mual suangpi tungah ka ding tu hi. Suangpi saat in, tua hile mihingte neak tu tui hong pusuak tu hi,” ci hi. Israel lampuite mai ah tuabangin Moses in vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua mun sia Massah le Meribah ci hi, banghang ziam cile Israel te in phun in Topa ze et a, “ Topa eite taw om ziam, hong ompui ngawl ziam?” ci in, a dokna mun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amalek mite hong pai in Rephidim ah Israel te sim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses in Joshua tungah, “Zing ciang Amalek mite a do tu in mi pawlkhat teal in. Kei sia mual dawnah ka ding tu a, Pathian ii keng a hong sawl ciangkhut ka toai tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moses thupiak bangin Joshua in Amalek mite do tu in a kuan hunsung in Moses, Aaron le Hur te mual dawnah kaato uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moses ii a khut a lap hunsung theampo Israel te in ngalzo a, ahizong a khut a khiaksuk ciang Amalek mite in zo tu in kipan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moses ii khut a toi ciang Aaron le Hur in a to natu in suangtum khat laaksak in amate a lang le a lang ah dingin nitum dong a khutte lapsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi bangin Joshua in Amalek mite zo siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in Moses tungah, “Hi ngalzawna thu teng a kiphaw natu in tepteena lai at in. Amalek mite ka mot natu thu Joshua tungah son in” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses in biaknatau khat sa a, a min phuakin, “ Topa sia ka Zawna Dial hi “Jehovah Nissi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in, “ Topa zawna dial saangkhai vun! Topa in Amalek mite a tawntungin do suak tu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses ii sunghpa, Midian thiampi Jethro in Moses ii Israel te Egypt ngam pan a pusuapui lai Pathian ii Moses le Israel mite atu a sepna thu theampo za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, Moses kungah ama pai in, nungsangah a kinusia Moses ii zi Zipporah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />le a tapate nii Gershom le Eliezer tonpui hi. (Moses in, “Ngamdang khat ah ngamdangmi khat hi zo khi hi,” ci hi; tua ahiciang a tapa khat ii min Gershom phuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in, “Egypt kumpipa ii hong thalup natu pan ka pa ii Pathian in hong hu in, hong hun hi,” ci si hi; tua ahikom a tapa khat sia ii min, Eliezer phuak hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses ii ngiaphual saatna mual thiangtho, sennealngam ah Jethro sia Moses ii zi le a tapate nii taw hong pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in amate paina thu Moses tungah zasak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua ahikom a muak tu in Moses pai a, ama mai ah kunin namh hi. Khat le khat nat le dam teng a kidok zawkciang Moses ii puanbuk sungah tum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moses in Jethro tungah Topa ii Israel te a hut natu in kumpipa le Egypt mihingte tungah a vawt theampo son hi. Lampi ah mihingte in haksatna a thuakna le Topa ii a hutna teng zongh son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jethro in hi thu teng a zaak ciang lungdam in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kumpipa le Egypt mite khut sung pan hong hun Topa pok vun! Ama ii mite saltanna pan a hun Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa sia pathian theampo sangin a let zawkna tu in ka he hi, banghang ziam cile Egypt te in Israel te tua bang a zawnsak vawt ciang Topa in hi bang seam hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciang Jethro in meihal biakpiakna buppi le a dang sangaw biakpiaknate Pathian tungah pia a; Aaron le Israel lampuite theampo, ama taw biakpiakna an thiangtho nekhawm tu in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A zing ciang Moses, a mite kihaunate lemtua in, zing pan nitak dong komla hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Moses ii nasep tu theampo Jethro in a mu ciang, “Mipite atu in na sep teng bang hi thong ziam? Banghangin na theampo nangma bek in seamin, hi lai ah thu hong dongh tute zing pan nitak dong dingsak ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses in, “Mihingte in Pathian ii deina a heak natu in, kei kungah hong pai ahikom hi bangin ka sep kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihing nii thu a nei ciang kei kungah hong pai uh a, a maw le a tang thukhensakin amate tungah Pathian thupiakte le thukhamte ka son hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciang Jethro in, “Na nasepzia maan ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangma le hi mihingte in na tha uh zawm law tu nu hi. Hite nang nguak sep tu in tam leih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu in ngaisutna pha pawlkhat hong piasak ta'n, tuaciang Pathian in nangma hong ompui tu hi. Mipite atu in palai na hi tu sia pha hi, amate thu kineinate Pathian mai ah na puak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa thupiakte na hil tu a, a nuntak tu zia le a nasep tu teng ama tungah na son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua banah mipil mithiam pawlkhat tealin a, mihingte lampui tu in koi in: tuate sia mihing a tul, a za, a sawmnga le a sawm sim te ii lampuite hi tu hi. Amate sia Pathian a kiita mihing muanhuai le sumnguk ne thei ngawlte ahi kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate sia mihingte atu a seam top tu thukhenpa hisak in. Thu nozaw teng amate in khensak in a, ahizong thu haksa theampo nangma kungah puaksak in. Tuasia in na vanhngitte hong dawn tu a, nang atu in olzaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian thupiak bangin, seam lete nangma zongh na thazawm ngawl tu hi, mihing theampo zongh a thu thiang in inn ah cia thei tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses in Jethro ii ngaisut piakna saang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel te sung pan mipil mithiamte teal hi. Ama in tua te sia mihing a tul, a za, a sawmnga le a sawm sim te ii lampui tu in panmun pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in mite atu a seam top tu thukhenmangte hi a, thu haksate Moses tungah puakin thu nozaw te ahile amate in khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moses in Jethro mangpha thaakin, Jethro a inn ah cia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite in Rephidim nusia a, tuaciang Egypt a nusiat zawk a tha thumna, ni masabel ni in, Sinai sennealngam theng uh hi. Tualai Sinai Mualpeang ah amate in ngiaphual saatin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian taw kimu tu in mual tungah Moses kaato hi. Topa in mualtung pan Moses samin, Jacob suan le paal Israel te tungah hi bang na son tu hi ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Keima, Topa in Egypt te tungah ka vawtte le muvanlai in a note a tha tungah a puak bangin note hi munah kong puak mu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu in ka thu hong ni in ka thuciamnate na zui uh le keima aituam mite hi tu nu hi. Leitung buppi keima aa hi a, ahizong note sia keima tealtuam mite na hi tu uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />keima tung bek ah hong ki aap minam khat na hi tu uh a, thiampite bangin ka na nong seam tu uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses tuaksuk a mipi lampui teng khawmin Topa thupiak theampo sonsiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuasia ciang mi theampo in, “ Topa ii ci theampo seam tu khu hi,” ci in zo a, Moses in Topa tungah hi a zona thu teng puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Nangma taw ih kipaupuinate mipite in a zaak natu le tu pan kipan nang hong up natu in meeilom saa khat taw kong pai tu hi,” ci hi. Mipite zona sa teng Moses in Topa tungah son a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in ama tungah, “Mipite kungah va pai ta'n a, biakna pia tu in tuni le zing ciang a kithiansua natu in son in. A puante sawp hamtang in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />thai ciang atu kingingkhol sa in om hen. Tua ni in Sinai Mual ah kong tuaksuk tu a, tualai ah mi theampo in hong mu thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipite ii a kaantan ngawl natu in mual kiimkot ah ngamngi tepteena khat vawt tavun a, mual tungah kaato ngawl, tuasia nai zongh a neak ngawl natu in son ta'n. Khat po in tuasia tung a siik le tua pa kithatlum tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ama kuama in thutha ngawl tu a, suang taw kideanglum ahibuale thal taw kikaplum tu hi. Hi thu in mihingte le nganhingte huam khawm a; tuate kithatlum nanak tu hi. Ahizong lemle hong kitum ciang mipite mual tungah kaato tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuasia ciang mual tung pan Moses tuaksuk a, biakna vawt tu in mite kithoaisak hi. Tua ahiciang amate a puan uh sawp hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuaciang Moses in amate tungah, “Thai ciang atu kinging khol tavun a, hi hun sungin numei le pa omkhopna nei heak vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ni thum ni zingsang ciang vanto in khualeng a, mual tungah meeilom saa khat hong kilangh in lemle aw nging mama khat kiza hi. Ngiaphual ah a om mihing theampo liingin lau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Moses in amate, Pathian taw kimu tu in ngiaphual pan pusua pui a, mualpeang ah amate ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sinai Mual buppi meikhu in siincip hi, banghang ziam cile Topa tua mualtung ah mei sungah hong tuaksuk hi. A khu sia mei phualpi khu bangin kaato in, mi theampo liinglawng ngawp uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lemle aw hong nging vaial hi. Moses in paupui a, Pathian in vanto taw in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sinai Mualdawn ah Topa hong tuaksukin, mualdawn ah Moses sam hi. Moses kaato a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in ama tungah, “Keima en tu in mite hong pai ciang ngamngi tepteena a kan ngawl natu in paisuk in va son ta'n; tuasia hong kan le tam mama thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei kung hong pai tu thiampite zongh a kithiansua phot kul tu hi, a kithiansua buale daan ka pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Moses in Topa tungah, “Mipite hong paito thei ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile nangma in mual sia thiangtho hi ci in ngaisut tu le tua ii kiimkot ah ngamngi tepteena khat vawt tu in thu nong pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in, “Tuaksuk ta'n a, Aaron hong paipui kik ta'n. Ahizong thiampite le mipite in kei kungah paito tu in tua ngamngi kaan ngawl het tu hi, tuabang a kaantan le amate daan ka pia tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuasia ciang mipite kungah Moses tuaksuk a, Topa ii ci teng amate tungah son hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in hi bang kammal teng son hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Keima in note saltanna Egypt pan hong pusuapui Topa na Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Keima simngawl pathian dang bia heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Vantung ahizong, leitung ahizong leinuai tui sungah ahizong note atu in na khat pawpo ii lim vawt heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Milim khat pawpo mai ah kun heak vun, ahibuale bia heak vun, banghang ziam cile keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi a, hong demte ka dual bua hi. Kei hong ngaimawte le amate ii a suan a paalte tungah khang thum khang li dongin daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahizong kei hong it in, ka thukhamte a zuite ahile ka itna a khang tul tampite tungah ka lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Keima min, a sia vawt natu in zangh heak vun, banghang ziam cile keima Topa na Pathian in ka min a zangh khial pawpo daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Sabbath tang vun a, tua ni thiangthosak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note na na sep natu in ni luk na nei uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ahizong a ni sali ni sia keima atu a kikoituam tawlngak ni ahi hi. Tua ni in kuama — nangma, na tate, na silate, na ngannote le na ngam sungah hong teang ngamdangmite khat zongh in naseam ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni luk sungin Keima Topa in leitung, vantung, tuipi le tuate sung a om theampo ka vawt a, ahizong ni sali ni in ka tawlnga hi. Tua ahi hu in Keima, Topa in Sabbath thupha pia in tua ni ka thiangthosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Keima kong piak ngam le lei ah khansau in na nuntak thei natu in na nu le na pa zakta vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Mihing that heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Palngul mawna vawt heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Nguta heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“A maan ngawlin khat pawpo mawsiat heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Midang khat ii inn lungngul heak vun: a zi, a silate, a khuite, a laate ahibuale a neisa khat pawpo lungngul heak vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mipite in khualeng vanto le lemle awngingte za in, khualeng le meikhu suak mual a mu ciang, lau in liing a, a khualana ah ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in Moses tungah, “Nangma in ko nong paupui le kong ngai tu uh hi; ahizong Pathian in kote hong paupui le ka thi tu lau khu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moses in, “Lau heak vun! note na khial ngawl natu hong sit tu in Pathian hong pai hi bek a, ama thu ni tawntung tu in hong vawt hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahizong mipite a khualana ah ding veve a, Pathian omna meeivom nai ah Moses bek pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel te tungah Moses ii son tu in Topa in thupia a: “Keima, Topa in vantung pan note kong paupui na zia mu zo ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima nong biak banah note biak tu in ngunn le khamh pathiante vawt heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lei taw kivawt biaknatau khat kei atu in vawt vun a, na tuute le na khuite taw meihal biakpiakna le kipawlkhop biakpiaknate tua biaknatau tungah pia vun. Kei nong biak natu in kong koi tuamsak mun teng ah kong pai tu a, thupha kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kei atu in suang taw biaknatau na vawt uh ahile, a ki attan suang taw sa heak vun, banghang ziam cile suang tungah sikkhu na zak uh ciang tua suang sia kei atu in zak tham man ngawl sua nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kei atu biaknatau na sak uh ciang a tungah kaato natu in keallei vawt heak vun; na vawt uh le a tung na kaato uh ciang noma sealno teng kilanghsak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Israel te tungah a nuai a thukhamte pia in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hebrew mi sila in na lei uh le, kum luk sung na hong sepsak tu hi. Kum sali kumin bangma pia ngawlin kisuaktasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na silapa sia na sila a sua lai in zi nei ngawl ahile hong nusiat ciang a zi tonpui ngawl tu a, ahizong zi neisa ahile a zi tonpui thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A topa in zi neisakin, tanu tapa a nei le a zi le a tano teng a topa ii neisa hi tu a, ama nguak pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahizong silapa in ka topa, ka zi, ka tate ka it hi ci in suataksak tu a nop ngawlna thu hong pualaak le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a topa in ama biakpiakna munah paipui tu hi. Tualai kongkha ahibuale kongkha khuam neal in ama dingsak tu a, a bil vutvangsak tu hi. Tuaciang a nuntak tawntung ama sila hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mihing khat in a tanu sia sila tu in a zuak le, pa silate bangin suakta thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua nu a zi tu in a nei nuam khat ii tungah kizuak a, ahizong tua pa in a dei bua le, tua nu sia a pa kungah kizuak kik tu hi; a topa in ngamdangmite tungah zuak thei ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile ama in tua nu a phatvawt ngawl sa ahihang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasal khat in a tapa a piak tu in sila numei khat a lei le tanu khat bangin vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing khat in zi ni a nei le a zi masa sia nidang a piak ngeiza an, puan le a nga tuakte a kibangin pia suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in a zi masa tungah hi bangin a vawt tu te a khuangkhim buale liausum bangma la ngawlin a suataksak kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Mihing khat vua in a that sia peuma kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahizong thalup sawm ngawlpi khutkhial tha ahile ama atu ka tealsa munah ngammuangin om tu a, suakta thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahizong mihing khat thin uuk in midang khat a thatlum lui le ka biaknatau beal tu in a tai zong kithat veve tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A nu ahibuale a pa a vua sia kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihing khat zuak tu ahizong, sila in khoai tu ahizong a ngu sia kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A nu ahibuale a pa a haamsiat sia kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing nii kihau in, khat pa in a dang khat pa suangtum taw suu ahibuale a khuttum taw thong a, ahizong a thatlum buanale tua pa daan kipia ngawl tu hi. Tua a thuakpa sia lupmuntung ngak ahihang, tua zawkciang tho thei in doipua a paina ah ciangkhut zak a kul le, dam ngawlin a om hun sung a supna teng a thaman liau tu a, a dam dong ou tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihing khat in a silapa ahibuale a silanu mol khat taw saatin thakhat thu a thi paih le, a saatpa daan kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahizong a sila sia ni khat, ni nii in a thi bua le, a topa daan kipia ngawl tu hi. A neisa a sup sia a kicing daan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mihingte kihau a naupaai numei khat nasakin, a tuamdang khat pawpo taw a liam hi ngawl napi a nau a lal le, a nasakpa in tua numei nu pasal ii a ngetza, thukhente thu khen bangin liau tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang tua numei a kiliamsua le tua daan sia nuntakna atu nuntakna ma,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />mittang atu mit, hatang atu ha, khut atu khut, peang atu peang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />meikaang atu meikaang, liamna atu liamna, chidup atu chidup ma hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mihing khat in a silanu ahibuale a silapa saatin a mit a taw le, a mittang atu in tua sila sia suaktasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A ha tang khat a tongsak le a ha taangin tua sila sia suatakna pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khuital khat in mihing khat a siilum le tua khuital suang taw kideanglum tu a, a sa kine ngawl tu hi; ahizong a neipa daan kipia ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahizong tua khuital in ngual a sik zongsang sa hi in, a neipa tungah a kidop natu kison zo napi khum ngawlin — mihing khat a siilum le tua khuital sia suang taw kideanglum tu a, a neipa zongh kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahizong tua a neipa sia a nuntakna a kihuukna in liausum a kipiasak le, a nget zaza a piak kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khuital khat in patangno khat ahibuale numeino khat a silum le tua zui tu ngeina sia taw ma a kibang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khuital in sila numei khat ahibuale sila pa khat a silum le ngan neipa in sila topa tungah sum ngunntang sawmthum pia tu a, tua khuital suang taw kideanglum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mihing khat in dum sitna a hon hang ahibuale dum to in a sit ngawl hu in, khuital ahibuale laa khat tua dum sungah a taak le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />ama in tua nganno ii man liau nanak tu hi. Ngan neipa tungah a sum pia tu a, tua nganhing thi sia ama in tang thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mihing khat ii khuital khat in midang khat ii khuital a silum le amate nii in a nungta khuital sia zuakin, a sum hawm tu hi; khuital thi sia ii sa zongh hawm tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahizong tua khuital sia ngual sik tu a zongsang khat hi ci in, kihe a, a neipa in khum ngawl ahile a dang khat pa tungah ama khuital nungta khat taw lo kik hamtang in sumsisak ngawl tu hi, ahizong khuital thi sia ama in tang tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mihing khat in khuipui ahibuale tuu khat ngu in a ngo, a zuak le ama in khuipui khat taangin khuipui nga, tuu khat taangin tuu li pia hamtang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in a nguk sia atu liau hamtang tu hi. Ama in bangma a nei buale a nguk sa teng a liau natu in ama sila in kizuak tu hi. A nguk nganhing sia khui, laa, tuu a nungta in ama khut sungah a kimu le ama in a zaa nii in liau tu hi. “Nguta khat in zan lai in inn phuul a, a kithatlum le a that pa sia mithat in kimawsak ngawl tu hi. Ahizong tuasia sun hun sung a piang ahile mithat in kimawsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Mihing khat in a ngannote lo ahibuale sapithuan khat ah tha in a tatsak laitak a ngante puapial in midang khat ii lo ah ankungte a neaksak le, ama lote ahibuale a sapithuante pan a bo teng lo kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mihing khat in ama lo pan meikuang khat kipan a, ngual dangkhat ii lo kipeesak in a kikhol ante ahibuale ankungte a kaangh le mei a kaanghsakpa in a lal teng liau tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mihing khat in midang khat ii sum ahizong, na manpha dangte ahizong kepsak tu in thukim a, ama inn pan kingu in, a ngupa a kikan zo le a zaa nii in kiliausak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahizong a ngupa a kimu buale vanh manphate a keampa sia biakna munah kipaipui tu a tua munah a nguksak ngawlna thu kiciam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Khui, laa, tuu, puansilh ahibuale nadang a bo khat pawpo taw kisai thuneina theampo ah tua na a kituu te nii sia biakna munah kipaipui tu hi. Pathian ii maw hi a ci sia pa in a langkhat pa tungah a zaa nii in liau tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mihing khat in ngual laa, khui, tuu nganhing dang khat kepsak tu thukim a, tua nganno thi, liam ahibuale a kitaipuisak ahihang tetti a om buale
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />biakna munah ngan keampa paipui tu a, ngual ngan a nguksak ngawlna thu a kiciam kul tu hi. A kingu ahibuale a neipa a sumh hi tu hi, tua pa in liau ngawl tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ahizong a kingu ahile a nei pa tung liau hamtang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngamsate ii thalup ahile a neakmongte tetti in a lak kul hi; ama in ngamsa ii thalup sia atu liau kul ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Mihing khat in ngual ngan zawng a, a nei pa om ngawl sungin a liamsak ahibuale, a thisak le tua pa in liau tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahizong a nei pa om sungin, tuabang thu piang ahile liau kul ngawl hi. Man piak tu in a kizawng ahile a zawn man teng taw kisi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mihing khat in a kidongh ngawl lai ngaknu thiangtho khat zolin a ompui le moman teng a piak kul a, tuaciang teenpui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahizong a numei ii pa in a kiteen tu a oai buale tua ngaknu khat atu moman za sia a sum in a pa tungah pia nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Bum le ai toai numei peuma kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Nganhing khat taw a khialpa peuma kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Keima., Topa simngawl, pathian dang tungah sangaw biakpiakna a vawt peuma kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ngamdangmi khat vawtsia ahibuale zothaw heak vun; Egypt ah ngamdangmite na hina uh phawk vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Meingong ahibuale tanga peuma na vawtsia heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na vawtsia uh le Keima Topa in amate ih hu hong ngetna aw ka zaak ciang ka zo tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ka thin uukin ngal sungah kong that tu hi. Na zite meingong tu a, na tate sia pa sel tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Keima ii mi ahi a zawng khat pawpo tungah sum na pukthaak uh le sum pukthaak pa bangin om heak vun a, summeet na la heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hong lo kik natu kikhapna in khat po ii puanvan silh lai na laaksak le, nitum ma in pia kik tu ni hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />banghang ziam cile a khualumna tu in a neisun sia tua puanvan bek ahi hi. Ama bangdang silhin mutthip thei tu ziam? Ama in kei tungah hu ngen a, hong au ciang zo tu khi hi, banghang ziam cile ngual hesuak thei khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Pathian na sonsia heak vun a, na minam lampuite na haamsiat heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Na lo an, na sapittui le na olive thau sung pan kei nong piak tute hong pia tavun. “Na tapaciilte kei hong pia tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na khui le na tuu a no suakciilte hong pia tavun, Tua a suakciil a pa sia ni sali sung a pui taw omsak in a, a ni liat ni in kei hong pia tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Note sia keima mihing na hi uh ciang ngamsate ii matsa nganhing ii sa peuma ne ngawlin uite pia zaw vun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“A maan ngawl kamdawn kizelsak heak vun a, a maw sia hu nuamin leilot tetti pang heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing a tamzawte ii khialna a vawt ciang le thutang khenna pan lam a pialsak tetti a pan ciang amate zui heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mizawng khat thu a kisitna ah ngum tuan heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na ngalpa ii khui ahibuale a laa a tai na mu uh le ama kungah puak kik vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama ii laa a vanh taw a puk na mu le a laa phokpui vun a; paisan heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mizawng khat thukhenzum a thet ciang thutang khenna taansak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A maan ngawlin ngual mawsiat heak vun a, mawnei ngawl khat that heak vun, banghang ziam cile tuabangin a sia a vawt peuma ka mawsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sumnguk ne heak vun, banghang ziam cile sumnguk in mihingte a maan bang musak ngawlin, a maw ngawlte mailam lalsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ngamdangmi khat vawtsia heak vun; ngamdangmite ii a thinsung thuakzia na he uh hi, banghang ziam cile Egypt ah note ngamdangmite na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kum luk sung na lo ah thai na ciing tu uh a, an piang teng na kaikhawm tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahizong kum sali kum sia tawlngasakin tua lo pan a piangte bangma la heak vun. Lo sung pan a lipote mizawngte in ne tahen a, a taanglai teng ngamsate in ne tahen. Na sapithuan le na olive kungte zongh tuabang ma in hi tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Nipi khat sung ni luk naseam in, ahizong ni sali ni in naseam heak vun, tua hile note na hong sepsak na silate le ngamdangmite, na ngannote zongh tawlnga thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Keima, Topa ii kong son theampo hong ngai tavun. A dang pathiante tungah thungen heak vun a; a min zongh lo heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Keima patoaina in kum khat sung thumvei poaipi khaam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kong thupiakna sa taw kizui in Egypt na nusiat tha ahi, Abib tha sungin Tol saw ngawl Anluum Poaipi khaam vun. Tua poaipi ni sali hun sung tol taw kivawt anluum peuma ne heak vun. Biakpiak natu khat keng ngawlin kei hong bia tu in hong pai heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Anlaak tu na kipat uh ciang Anlaak Poaipi khaam vun. ‘Na sapithuan le na thingnga huan pan thingngate na kaikhop uh ciang tangngam hun sungin Anlaak Poaipi khaam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum sim hi poaipi thumte ah keima, Topa na Pathian hong bia tu in na mite theampo hong pai nanak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Nganhing khat taw biakpiakna nong vawt uh ciang tol saw anluum hong pia heak vun. Hi poaipi te sungah sangaw biakpiakna nong vawt uh ciang nganhing thaute sia a zingsang ciang dongin koi heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Kum simin na lo anpal sia Topa na Pathian inn sungah hong paipui tavun. “Tuuno ahibuale kealno sa, a nu noaitui sungah huan heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Na khualhawna ah hong cing tu le ka vawtkholsa munah hong paipui tu in na mai ah vantunglalang khat ka paisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama thudon in, a thu ni tavun. Ama leedo heak vun, banghang ziam cile keima sawl hi a, tuabang leedona sia hong maisak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahizong ama ii thu ni in kong thupiak theampo na seam uhle na ngalte theampo kong simsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na mai ah ka vantunglalang pai in, Amor te, Hit te, Periz te, Canaan te, Hiv te le Jebus te ngam ah hong paipui tu a, tuaciang amate ka sucip siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate ii pathiante mai ah kunin bia heak vun, amate ii biakna ziate zui heak vun. A pathiante suksiat sakin a suangkhuam thiangthote sutham vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa na Pathian keima nong bia uh le an le tui taw thupha kong pia tu a, note natna theampo kong laaksak siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na ngam na lei ah numei nautol om ngawlin, a tasel zongh om ngawl tu hi. Keima in note khansauna kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“No hong langpan mihingte in keima hong kiitak natu in ka vawt tu hi; na do ngalte sungah buaina ka omsak tu a, note kung pan na ngalte theampo kilee in ka taisak siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na ngalte ka patausak tu hi; note maisang nawt in na pai uh ciang Hiv mite, Canaan mite, le Hit mite ka notkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kum khat sungin amate ka notkeak siat buatu hi; notkeak siat thong leng tua ngam sia ngamtongta suak tu a, note atu in ngamsate tam leih tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua sangin tua ngam a lua khom tu mihing na om thei mateng tawtawm in ka not tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na ngamngi uh kong vawtsak tu a, Aqaba Tuidok pan Mediterranean Tuipi dong le sennealngam pan Eupharates Ngun dong hi tu hi. Tua ngam ah a teangte tungah vaang neina kong pia tu a, maisang na manaw uh ciang na notkeak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate taw ahizong a pathiante taw ahizong thukimna peuma vawt heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua mihingte na ngam sungah teangsak heak vun; na teangsak uh le amate in kei tungah na maw na khial natu hong vawt tu hi. A pathiante na bia uh le note atu in hong thisak thei thaang hi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Nangma le Aaron, Nadab, Abihu le Israel lampui sawmsalite ka kung mual tungah hong kaato tavun a; a khuala thithimna ah na om uh laitak kunin hong bia tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A dangte hi ngawl, nangma bek in ka kung nong pai tu hi, midangte kuama in hong neak ngawl tu hi. Mipite sia mualtung ngawngawn zong ah kaato ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses pai in a mipite tungah Topa thupiak teng le zui tu thu teng son a, mihing theampo in, “ Topa ci theampo ka vawt siat tu uh hi,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa thupiak theampo Moses in at siat hi. A zing ciang zing tuungin mualpeang ah Moses in biaknatau khat sa in, Israel minam sawm le niite atu in suangtum sawm le nii phut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in tangvalte sawl a. amate in meihal biakpiaknate le khui pawl khat ngoin kipawlkhop sangaw biakpiakna te Topa tungah vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses in nganhing te ii chisan a lang la in kuang sungah koi a; a lang sia biaknatau ah the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moses in Topa thupiak teng a ki at, thuciamna laibu la in mipite tungah nging takin sim hi. Amate in, “ Topa thu ka ni tu uh a, ama thupiak theampo ka vawt siat tu uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Moses in kuangte sung pan chisan la in mipite the hi. Ama in, “Hi chisan sia Topa ii hi thu teng hong piak lai in, ama ii note taw a vawt thuciamna a kipsak chisan ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses, Aaron, Nadab, Abihu le Israel lampui sawmsalite mual tungah kaato a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />amate in Israel te ii Pathian mu uh hi. A peang nuai ah vancii bang ahi, sapphire suangpheak khat taw a kibang om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in Israel lampuite bangma law ngawl hi; amate in Pathian mu a, tua zawkciang amate an nekhawm tui dawnkhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Keima kung mual tungah hong kaato ta'n a, hi lai ah na om sungin mihingte kihil natu in keima at sa thukham teng theampo a om suangpheak nii kong pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses le ama a hupa Joshua kithoai a, mual thiangtho ah kaato tu in Moses kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Moses in lampuite tungah, “Kong heak kik uh mateng hi lai ngiaphual pan hong ngak tavun. Aaron le Hur, note taw hi lai ah om hi; tua ahikom thukhen tu buaina a nei pawpo in amate kungah pai thei tu nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sinai Mual ah Moses kaato in, meei in tua mual tuamcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa ompuina khuavak taang velvol sia mual tungah hong theng suk hi. Tua khuavak taang sia Israel mite atu in mualdawn ah a taang meikuang khat taw kibang hi. Ni luk sung meei in mual tuamcip in, a ni sali ni in meei sung pan Topa in Moses sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mualtung meei sungah Moses kaato hi. Tua munah Moses sun sawmli le zan sawmli om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kei tungah sumpi hong piak natu in Israel te son in. A pia nuam khat pawpo ii sumpite saang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi sumpite sia: khamh, ngunn le taau;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />puanneal, vancii, a sandup le a san samulpuan; kealmul taw kivawt puan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a san a kinimh tuuvun, savun neal, acacia thing;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />meidet sathau, noi sathau le ngimnamtui atu hel namtuite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thiampi Lianbel ii ephod tung le awmdal te tungah bul tu suangsante le suangmanpha dangte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate sungah ka teen thei natu in, kei atu in mite in puanbuk thiangtho khat vawt tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuasia le a sung nazak tu te theampo kong lak tu ngealna bangin vawt tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Acacia thing taw thingkuang a sau centimetre 110, a zai centimetre 66, a saang centimetre 66 khat vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A sung a pua khamh ciitak taw tuam in a, a mong kiimkot khamh taw zial in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A zawn natu khamh kual li vawt in a, a pangh lang le lang ah nii veve, a peang lite tungah bul in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A zawn natu in acacia thingpum sui in a, khamh taw tuamin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />thingkuang pangh veve ah a kibul khamh kualte sungah thun in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua thingpumte khamh kualte sungah kinusia tu a, kila nawn ngawl het tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciang nang kong piak tu thupiak teng a ki at suangpheak niite thingkuang sungah koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A sitna khamh ciitak taw vawt in, a sau centimetre 110, a zai centimetre 66 hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kiseakpeak khamh taw cherub nii ii lim vawt in a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a sitna mong veve ah koi in. A sitna taw kipee, a sakhat tu in vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cherub niite ii lim sia a sitna tungah khat le khat kimaingat tu a, a tha kiphalte in tuasia liap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Suangpheakte nii thingkuang sungah koi in a tungah a sitna koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualai ah kong kisikpui tu a, cherub te ii a thate nii kilaklaw, a sitna tung panin Israel mite atu, ka thukhamte theampo nang kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Acacia thing taw a sau centimetre 88, a zai centimetre 44, a saang centimetre 66 sabuai khat vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />khamh ciitak taw tuamin, a mong kiimkot khamh taw zial in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A kiil kiimkot millimetre 75 zaisakin, khamh taw tuam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khamkual li vawt in a, a peang omna king li ah bul in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua khamh kualte sabuai zawn natu thingpumte thun natu hi a, sabuai kiil ah bul tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A thingpumte acacia thing taw vawt in a, khamh taw tuam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sapittui biakpiakna ah a kizangh tu pakante, haite, haitungte le kuangte vawt in. Hi teng khamh ciitak taw kivawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sabuai sia Thuciamna Thingkuang mai ah kikoi tu a, kei hong kipia anluum thiangtho sia tua sabuai tungah kilui tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Khamh ciitak taw meivakna khuam vawt in. A tawdap le a khuamte a kiseakpeak khamh taw vawt in; a zepna paakte, a momte le paakpalhte zongh meikhuam taw sakhat hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A khuam panghte pan baak luk kaasak tu a, a lang le lang ah baak thum veve om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A baak luk te khat simin almond paak bangin a mom le a palh taw a kithua paak nam thum nei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A meikhuam sia almond paak bangin a mom le a paakpalh taw a kithua kizepna paak pha nam li nei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kop thum a pha a baakte sim ii nuai ah a mom khat tek om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A momte, a baakte le meikhuam sia a kiseakpeak khamh ciitak bek khat taw a kivawt hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A mai sang a taan thei natu in tua meivak khuam tungah meivak sali de in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Taiteete le kuangdalte khamh ciitak taw vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hi meikhuam le a nadang teng vawt natu in khamh ciitak kilogramme 35 zangh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mual tungah kong lak ngealna sia bang tatak in, tua nate pha takin vawt in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Kong ompuina Puanbuk, a thiangtho puanbuk sungsang sia vancii, a sandup, le a san tuumul taw a kitak puanneal bek sawm taw vawt in. Tua puante cherub limte taw zeam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua puante a letna kikim tu a, metre 12 sau in metre 2 zai veu hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua puan ngate khatin khuikhawmin, a dang nga teng zongh tuabang ma khuikhawm in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na puan pee khop khat simin a puasang puanbek ii mong tung teng ah vancii puan kualte vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A puan masa sia tungah kual sawmnga koi in a, a niina puan sia tung zongh ah a kibangin kual sawmnga ma koi in kisituasak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua puante nii sia puan khai khat in na pe thei natu khamh taw kivawt a khilna koaite sawmnga vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Puanbuk ii a tung sit natu in kealmul taw kivawt puanbek sawm le khat vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua teng a letna kibangsak in, metre 13 sausak in, metre 2 zaisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua puanbek nga teng khatin khui khawm in a, a dang luk teng khatin khuikhawm in. A lukna puanbek sia Puanbuk mai ii tung san ah thep nii in thep in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na khuikhop puankhai khat ii puanbek khakbel sia ii mong tungah a kual sawmnga vawt in a, a dang khat sia mong zongh ah a kual sawmnga vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puante kipee khop natu in taaukoai sawmnga vawt in a, a sitna khat suak tu in a kikhui khawmsa puante nii ii a kualvangte sungah thun in a pe in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puanbuk nungsangah tua puanbek vaal ii a lang sia kaaisuksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua puankhai sia a sau lamin a mong vaal centimetre sawmnga veve sia Puanbuk pangh tek ah kaaisuksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Puanbuk sit natu a sanin a kinimh tuutal vun taw kivawt a sitna khat le savun neal taw kivawt a sitna dangkhat te ngeal vawt lai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Acacia thing taw Puanbuk a kalpheak dingtangte vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuate khat sim a sauna metre 4, a saana centimetre 66 hi tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a kipee thei natu in a meang nii vawt in. A kalpheak theampo tuabangin vawt siat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thang sang atu a kalpheak kul,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a nuai phaa tu ngunn taw kivawt tawdap sawmli vawt in a, a meangte a len tu in ngunn tawdap nii tek koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Puanbuk saksang atu a kalpheak kul,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a kalpheak khat ciang tawdap nii veu, ngunn tawdap sawmli vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nitumna sang Puanbuk nungsangah a kalpheak luk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />le a kingte atu in a kalpheak nii vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hi a king a kalpheakte sia a bul pan pe in a dawn dong kizom siat tu hi. Tua king nii a piangsak a kalpheakte nii sia, tubangin kivawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuabangin a kalpheakte liat om tu a, khat simin tawdap nii veu, ngunn tawdap sawm le luk om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Acacia thingzawl sawm le nga vawt in, Puanbuk a kalpheakte atu in a pangh khat ah zawl nga veu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a langkhat ah a kalpheak nga le a nungsang nitumna sang khakbel ah a kalpheak nga vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A lai zawlsau, a kalpheakte nii ii lang kikhenna ah a kithung sia Puanbuk langkhat pan langkhat dong, a tuantung hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A kalpheakte khamh taw tuamin, a zawlte tum natu khamh kualte bulin a, a zawlte zongh khamh taw tuam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mual tungah kong lak ngealna sa om bangin Puanbuk sa in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Vancii, a sandup le a san samul taw a kitak puanneal puankhai khat vawt in. Tuate cherub te ii limte taw zeam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ngun tawdap li tungah a kiphut, vanh khaina a koaite a kithua khamh taw a kituam acacia thing khuam li tungah tua puan khai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Puanbuk innciing nuai ah puankhainate pan puankhai khaksuk in a, tua puan nungah suangpheak niite koina Thuciamna Thingkuang koi in. Tua puan in Thiangtho Mun le Thiangthobel Mun kidaakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thuciamna Thingkuang sitna thua in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thiangthobel Mun ii pua sang, Puanbuk ii saksang pangh ah sabuai koi in a, thangsang pangh ah meidetna khuam koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Puanbuk sung tumna puankhai tu in vancii, a sandup le a san samul taw a kitak thiamngelte taw a kizeam puanneal puankhai khat vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hi puankhai atu in khamh taw a kituam le puankhaina khamh koai a kibul acacia thing khuam nga phut in; tua khuamte atu in taau tawdap nga vawt in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Acacia thing taw biaknatau khat vawt in. Tua in king li nei tu a, a sauna metre 2.2, a zaina metre 2.2, a saanna metre 1.3 hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A king li dawn teng doksak in. Tua a dok teng biaknatau taw sakhat suak tu in, taau taw kituam siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sathau baang vut koi natu in bealpeute le kawkeaute, kuangte, thikkoaite le meikam luana daalpheakte vawt in. Hi nazakte theampo taau taw kivawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Taau taw saaksai khat vawt in, a king li ah toai natu taaukual li koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua taau saaksai sia biaknatau ii a lang dong a bat natu in biaknatau bitha nuai ah koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A zawn natu Acacia thingpumte vawt in, taau taw tuam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biaknatau a kizawn ciang a panghte nii ah a om a kualte sungah thingpumte thun in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mual tungah ngealna kong laksa bangin biaknatau sia thingpheak taw vawt in a, a sung vangsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Kong ompuina Puanbuk tu sia puanneal puankhaite taw doituam khat uum in. Thangsang pangh puankhaite sia metre 44 sau tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua puan sia taau tawdap khat tek a nei taau khuam kul tungah na khak tu uh a, tua khuamte tungah ngunn taw a kivawt puankhainate le a zawlte om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Doituam ii saksang pangh zongh ah tuabang ma in vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nitumna sangah metre 22 a sau puankhaite, khuam sawm le a dap sawmte taw om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nisuana sang, kongbiang omna ah a doituam zongh metre 22 zai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kongbiang ii a pangh veve ah puankhaite metre 6.6 veu, khuam thum le a tawdap thumte taw om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A tumna kongbiang san ah vancii, a sandup, le a san samul taw a kitak thiamngelte taw a kizeam metre 9 a sau puanneal puankhai khat om tu hi. Tua in tawdap li taw a kiphut khuam li tungah kikhak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kiimkot uumna khuam teng ngunnzawlte taw kizom a, vanh khainate ngunn taw a kivawt hi in a tawdapte taau taw a kivawt hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A doituam sia metre 44 sau, metre 22 a zai le metre 2.2 a saang hi tu hi. Puankhaite puanneal taw kivawt tu a, a taw teng taau taw kivawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puanbuk atu a kizangh vanh theampo le puanbuk atu le a doituam tu in, a kizangh khetphin theampo taau taw kivawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Nitak simin meiinn a kidet thei natu in olive thau phabelte nang kung hong puak natu in Israel mite thupia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kong ompuina Puanbuk sung, Thuciamna Thingkuang mai, puankhai pua sangah Aaron le a tapate in meiinn koi tu uh hi. Tua mun keima omna ah nitak pan zingsang dong mei de tu uh hi. Hi thupiak sia Israel te le a suan a paalte in a tawntung a zui tu uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Na suapuipa Aaron le a tapate Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar le Ithamar te sam in. Keima tungah thiampi na a sep thei natu in amate Israel mite sung pan tuamkoi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na suapuipa Aaron sia a vaang nei natu le a et hoi natu in thiampi puante vawtsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima na a seam tu in a ki aap thiampi khat a sua thei natu in thiamna ka piaksa khut thiam naseamte theampo samin Aaron ii puansilhte khui tu in sam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in awmdal khat, ephod puan khat, puantual khat, thiamngel taw kizeam laktong khat, dialkhip khat le kawngsawmna khau khat a vawt natu in sawl in. Amate in ka na a seam thei thiampite a sua natu in khutthiamte in na suapui pa Aaron le a tapate atu in hi thiampi puante khuisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khutthiamte in vancii, a sandup, a san samul, khamh khau le puanneal phate zangh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Amate in ephod sia vancii, a sandup, le a san samul, khamh khau le puanneal phate taw vawtin, thiamngel taw zeam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kikhit thei natu in, a liangko lang le lang ah a sawmna khau nii om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A dangte taw a vawtdan a kibang, pha tak a kitak kawng sawmna khau sia ephod taw sakhat tu in a tungah thuap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suangmanpha san nii la in, a tungah Jacob tapa sawm le niite min at in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />amate pianna suana taw kizui in a min luk te suang khat tungah at in, a dang luk te ii min teng suang dang khat tungah at in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suang manpha a zeamthiamte khat in hi suangte nii tungah Jacob tapa sawm le niite min atsak in a, tua suangte khamh dapphate tungah suang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuate Israel minam sawm le niite taangin ephod liangkhai puan tungah koi in. Tuabangin Aaron in a minte a liangko tungah pua tu a, tuasia ciang keima Topa in ka mite ka phawk tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khamh dappha nii na vawt zawk uh ciangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />khamh ciitak taw a kivawt zam nii te khau bang a kipheak sa in ngui nii vawt in, khamh dappha sia taw na khii khawm tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Pathian ii deina heak thei natu in, a kizangh awmdal khat Thiampi Lianbelpa atu in vawt in. Tuasia ephod vawtnate taw ma kibangin a kivawt, thiamngel taw a kizeam hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A tung a phei a kikim king li nei thep nii in kithep tu a, centimetre 22 sau, centimetre 22 zai hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua tungah suangmanpha ngual li in na suan tu a; ngual khatna ah ruby khat, topaz khat le garnet khat hi tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngual niina ah emerald khat, sapphire khat le diamond khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ngual thumna ah turquoise khat, agate khat le amethyst khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />le ngual lina ah beryl khat, carnelian khat le jasper khat hi tu hi. Hite khamh dapphate sungah kisuang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel minamte taangin Jacob tapa khat tek ii min a ki at suang sawm le nii na koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Awmdal atu in khauhual taw kibangin a kipheak khawm khamh ciitak khi ngui vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khamkual nii vawt in, awmdal tung sang kingte veve ah suan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua khamh khauhual te nii sia, a kual te nii tungah khit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A khauhual ii mong te nii sia dappha te nii tungah khit in a, tuaciang ephod ii liangkhai maisang ah thua in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaciang khamh kual nii vawt in, awmdal a nuai king veve ephod mong sung sangah suan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khamkual nii vawt in, ephod maisang liangkhai nuai ah khitin pha tak a kitak kawngkhau tungah sawm in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kawngkhau tungah pha tak a om thei natu le awmdal a kol ngawl natu in, awmdal khaute ephod khaute tungah khau vancii khat taw sawm khawm in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Keima Topa in ka mite ka phawk tawntung natu in, Thiangtho Mun ah Aaron a tum ciang Israel minamte min a ki at awmdal silh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuabangin a thiangtho kong ompuina sungah Aaron hong pai ciang a ken thei tu in ama awmdal sungah Urim le Thummim koi in. Israel mite atu in ka deina a heak thei natu in tuabang hun ciangin tua awmdal ama in silh tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Ephod puan nuai ah silh tu puantual sia vancii samulpuan siuseu taw kivawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lu thun natu a vang om tu a, tua a vang kiimkot sia a ek ngawl natu in a kitak sa puan taw tuam thua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A nuai kiimkot ah vancii, a sandup le a san samul puan taw a kivawt talee nga te khamh tengeng te taw a kithatheak in koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Aaron in thiampi na a sep ciang tua puantual silh tu hi. Ka ompuina Mun Thiangtho ah ama hong pai ciang ahibuale a pusua ciang tengeng nging kiza tu a, ama kithatlum ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Khamh ciitak taw kizepna khat vawt in a, a tungah ‘ Topa atu Kitavaw’ ci in at in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua kizepna sia lu khipdial mai ah vancii meal khau khat taw khit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mite in biakpiakna a vawt ciang khialna pawlkhat a vawt hial zong, Israel te ii kei tung hong aap biakpiakna theampo ka san natu in Aaron in tua kizepna sia a tal ah suang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Puanneal pha taw Aaron laktong le lu khipdial le thiamngel taw a kizeam kawngsawmna khat zongh vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Aaron tapate ii vaang nei natu le et hoi natu in, laktong, kawngsawmna le lukhu vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hi puante na suapuipa Aaron le a tapate silhsak in. Tuaciang amate in ka na a seam thei thiampite ahi natu in thupha piak kipsakna le aapna in olive thau taw zut in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A ci a sa a kimu ngawl natu in a kawng pan a pheizang ciang a pha ngoaipuante khuisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate in a sealno teng a kimu hu in, thalupna a thuak ngawl natu in ka omna Puanbuk ah hong pai ciang ahibuale Mun Thiangtho ah thiampi naseam tu in biaknatau hong neak ciang tua ngoaipuan teang tawntung tu hi. Tua in Aaron le a suan a paalte atu in a zui tu ngeina kip ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Aaron le a tapate ka na a seam thiampi tu in na aap ciang hi bangin na vawt tu hi. A mealhem ngawl khuital moi khat le tuutal nii keng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tol saw ngawl zungtaang vui phabel zangh in olive thau taw anluum pawlkhat, olive thau ngawl taw anluum pawlkhat le sathau taw a kizut moh pawlkhat vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuate khum sungah koi in, khuital le tuutalte nii biakpiakna in na ngaw uh ciang hong pia tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Aaron le a tapate kong ompuina Puanbuk tumna kongbiang ah hong paipui in, amate a zeksa kibualna neisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang Aaron sia thiampi puante — laktong, ephod, ephod nuai ah a kisilh puantual silhsak in, awmdal le kawngkhau thuasak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lu tungah dial khimsakin, tua tungah, ‘ Topa atu Kitavaw’ a kici a thiangtho ki aapna lim kizepna sia suang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaciang noi sathau la in, a lu tungah buakin, noai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“A tapate paipui in puante silhsak in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a kawng ah kawngsawmna khau sawm in, a lu tungah lukhu khusak in. Hi bangin Aaron le a tapate thiampi naseam tu in thupha pia in kipsak tu hi. Amate le a suan a paalte in a tawntungin thiampi panmun taw ka na seam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ka omna Puanbuk mai ah khuital hong paipui ta'n a, khuital lu tungah a khut a ngak natu in Aaron le a tapate son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualai a thiangtho ka ompuina Puanbuk tumna kongbiang ah khuital ngo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuital chi tawm la in, biaknatau dokte tungah na khutme taw noai in. Tuaciang a om lai teng biaknatau bul ah sung in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a sungthau theampo, a thin sa phabel na mun le, a nauta te nii le nauta a tuam a thaute la in, keima biakna in biaknatau tungah hal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahizong khuital satak, a vun le a sungkua theampo ngiaphual pua sangah hal in. Tua in thiampite mawna teng phelsak natu biakpiakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tuutal khat hong paipui ta'n a, Aaron le a tapate in tuutal lu tungah a khut a ngak natu in sawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua tuutal ngoin, a chi la in biaknatau pangh li teng ah the in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A sa semin; a sungkua le a nung peangte sil in a, a lu le a sa dangte tungah koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuutal sa theampo biaknatau tungah an biakpiakna in hal in. Tua biakpiakna ii a ngimnam in keima hong lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ki aapna in a kizangh tuutal — tuutal dangkhat sia — la in a, Aaron le a tapate in tua sia ii lu tungah a khut a ngak natu in sawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua tuutal ngoin, a chi tawm la in Aaron le a tapate bil ziatsang dawn, a ziatsang khutpi tung, le a ziatsang peangpi tungah noai in. A om lai chi teng biaknatau pangh li tengah the in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Biaknatau tungah a om chi tawm le noi sathau tawm la in Aaron le a puante tung, a tapate le a puante tungah the in. Aaron, a tapate le amate ii puante kei tungah hong ki aap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tuutal thau, a meici thau, a sungthau, a thinsa phabelna, a thau, a nautate nii le nauta a tuam a thau, a ziatsang phei hoaikeak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kei tungah nong piaksa anluum khum sung pan a nam simin: olive thau taw kivawt anluum khat, olive thau kihel ngawl anluum khat le moh phaang khat tek la vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Hi an theampo Aaron le a tapate khut sungah koi in a, kei tungah a letsong tuam khat in hong aap natu in son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate tung pan anluumte la in a, biaknatau tung, meihal biakpiakna tungah an taw keima nong biakpiakna in hal in. Hi biakpiakna ngimnam in keima hong lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tuutal awmsa la in, kei tungah letsong tuam khat in nong aap tu hi. Hi tuu awmsa baak sia nangma atu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Thiampi khat thupha pia in a kikipsak ciang, a kizangh tuu awmsa le a pheisate sia keima tungah letsong tuam khat in nong aap tu a, thiampite atu in kikoituam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi thu a kikheal ngawl ka thukhenna hi a, ka mite in kipawlkhop biakpiakna a nei ciang, nganno awmsa le a pheisate thiampite neisa hi tu hi. Tua sa sia amate ii keima Topa tungah hong piak letsong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Aaron ii thiampi puante ama thi zawkciang a tapate tungah ki aap tu a, amate thupha piak kipsakna a kinei ciang a silh tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thiampi seam tu in Aaron tapa in keima ompuina Puanbuk sung Thiangtho Mun ah hong pai ciang ni sali sung tua puante silh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Aaron le a tapate thiampi kipsakna in a kizangh tuutal sate la in mun thiangtho ah huan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Keima omna Puanbuk tumna kongbiang ah tua sate le khum sungah a taang anluumte nekhawm tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate in thiampi kikipsak na ah, mawmaisakna taw kisai in a zeksa vawtna ante ne tu uh hi. Tua ante an thiangtho ahikom thiampite bek in ne tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sa ahizong, anluum ahizong zingsang dongin neakmong a om lai le kihal tu hi; tuate sia an thiangtho ahikom kine ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Aaron le a tapate atu in thupha piak kipsakna ngeinate kong thupiak bang linlian in ni sali sung vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mawna a kimaisak thei natu in ni simin khuital khat biakpiakna in pia nanak tu ni hi. Tua in biaknatau thiansua tu hi. Tua zawkciang a thiantho natu in olive thau noai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuabangin ni sali sung ni simin vawt in. Tuasia ciang biaknatau sia thiangtho sitset tu a, tuasia a thutha mihing khat ahibuale na khat peuma biaknatau ii thianthona vaang in ngim ngasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Hong pai tu hun theampo ah ni simin biaknatau ah kum khat a pha tuuno nii biakpiakna in pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Zingsang in khat, nitakin khat biakpiakna in pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A masa tuu sia taw in olive thau thiang litre khat taw kihel anvui kilogramme khat pia khawm in. Biakpiakna in sapittui litre khat buak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A niina tuu sia nitak biakpiakna in nei in, zingsang a bangma in anvui, olive thau le sapittui biakpiakna in pia in. Hi sia keima Topa an biakpiakna hi a, tua ii ngimnam in keima hong lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hong pai tu hun theampo ah hi meihal biakpiakna sia ka ompuina Puanbuk tumna kongbiang, keima mai ah hong kipia tu hi. Tua munah ka mite kong mu tu a, kong paupui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tualai ah Israel mite ka mu tu a, kong ompuina khuavak taang velvol sia in tua mun thiangthosak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Puanbuk le biaknatau ka thiangthosak tu a, Aaron le a tapate in thiampi na seam tu in ka tuam koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Israel mite sungah ka teang tu a, amate ii Pathian ka hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Israel mite sungah ka teen thei natu in keima in Egypt pan amate a pusuapui Topa a Pathian ka hina amate in he tu uh hi. Keima in amate ii Pathian Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Paaknamtui hal natu in biaknatau khat acacia thing taw vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sau centimetre 45, a zai centimetre 45, le a saang centimetre 90 hi tu a, a pangh kikim in kiing li nei tu hi. A kiing li in a dokte biaknatau taw sakhat hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sitna tung, a pangh li teng le a dokte khamh ciitak taw tuam in a, a mong kiimkot teng khamh taw zial in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A zawn natu thingpumte thun natu in khamh kual nii vawt in, a tungsang pangh a kiingte nii nuai ah bul in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A zawnna thingpumte acacia thing taw vawtin, khamh taw tuam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuciamna Thingkuang mai ah a kikhai puankhaite pua sangah tua biaknatau koi in. Tua mun sia no kong mu natu mun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aaron in zing simin meivakte kinging tu hong pai ciang biaknatau tungah ngimnamtui hal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in nitakin mei a det ciang tuabang ma in vawt tu hi. Hi ngimnamtui biakpiakna sia hong pai tu hun theampo tatsat ngawlin a vawt tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi biaknatau tungah a kikhaam ngimnamtui biakpiakna, nganhing biakpiakna ahibuale, antang taw biakpiakna bangma pia heak vun, Sapittui biakpiakna zongh buak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mawphelna in a kipia nganhing chi, tua biaknatau dok lite tung a noina taw Aaron in kum khatin khatvei a zeksa biaknatau thiansuana vawt tu hi. Hi biakpiakna sia hong pai tu hun theampo kum simin kivawt tu hi. Keima Topa tungah hong ki aap hi biaknatau sia thiangtho sitset tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Israel mite ii mihing simna a nei ciang, a mi phaza a kisim laitak amate tungah tuasiatna a thet ngawl natu in mi theampo in a nuntakna ii man kei tungah hong pia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihing simna ah a kihel peuma in, a kizangh ngei khaikhin taw tee in a kinget za sum pia tu hi. A kuama po in tua sumte kei tungah biakpiakna in hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kum kul pan a tungsia a pha peuma mihing simna ah a kihel theampo in kei tungah tua sum hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A nuntakna ii man hi sum a piak uh ciang a haute in a tamzaw, a zawngte in a tawmzaw ci bangin pia ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mite tung pan hi sum khon in a, ka ompuina Puanbuk puuaphatna in zangh in. Hi phiangshia sia a nuntakna ii man tu hi a, tuasia taw amate ka cin ka kep tu ka phawk tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Taaukuang khat le taau taw kivawt a ngakna khat vawt in. Puanbuk le biaknatau kilaklaw ah koi in a, a sungah tui koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate in tua tui a khut le a peangte silna in a zak tu hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />amate puanbuk sung ahibuale biaknatau nai ah biakpiakna ante pia tu in a pai ma in kisil tu hi. Tuasia ciang amate kithatlum ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate a thi ngawl natu in a khut le a peangte a sil kul hi. Hi ngeina sia amate le a suan a paalte in a tawntung a zui tu ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“A phabel hel namtuite — Myrrh paaknamtui tui kilogramme 6, a ngimnamtui thingzungthum kilogramme 3, tu ngimnamtui kilogramme 3,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />le cassia kilogramme 6 la in. (A vekpi in a ngitna sia a kizangh ngei khaikhin taw kitee hi tu hi.) Olive thau litre 4 belap in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />paaknamtui hel bangin noi sathau thiangtho vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi sathau sia ka ompuina Puanbuk, Thuciamna Thingkuang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />sabuai le a na theampo, meikhuam le a na theampo, paaknamtui halna biaknatau,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />meihal biakpiakna biaknatau le a na theampo le kisilna kuang le a ngakna teng noai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi nate hi bangin na aap tu uh a, tua hile thiangtho sitset tu hi. Tuate a thutha peuma tua thianthona vaang in ngim ngasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaciang Aaron le a tapate sathau noai in a, keima na a seam thiampi tu in thupha taw kipsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel mite tungah, ‘Hi a thiangtho noi sathau sia ka nasepna sung hong pai tu hun theampo ah kizangh top tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hi sathau sia nautaangte tungah na buak buatu uh a, hisia taw a kibang khat po vawt natu in hi sathau helzia sia ma na zangh buahet tu uh hi. Tuasia in thiangtho a, a thiangtho in na vawt kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hi sathau taw a kibang a vawt khat po ahibuale thiampi ahi ngawl khat pawpo tungah a zangh sia keima mi in kisim nawn ngawl tu hi,’ ci in” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “A nuai a hel namtuite — stacte, onycha, galbanum le frankincense paaknamtui ciitak te a khen kikim tekin la in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua nate paaknamtui hel bangin, ngimnamtui vawtna ah zangh in. A sit ahi natu le a thiantho natu in ci saw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aheap sia suuvui in a, ka ompuina Puanbuk ah paipui in, Thuciamna Thingkuang mai ah the in. Hi ngimnamtui sia a thiangtho sinsen in ngaisun in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua paaknamtui taw kibangin noma atu khat po sia a helnazia sia ma zangh in na vawt buatu hi. Kei tungah hong ki aap a thiangtho na khat bangin ngaisun in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua paaknamtui taw kibangin zak tu khat po a vawt a om le keima mi in kisim nawn ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Judah minam sung pan Hur ii tupa ahi, Uri ii tapa Bezalel ka teal zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ka vaangletna taw ama ka dimsak zo hi. Teltheina, thiamna, thiamneal tuatuam hi theina —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />pungsaan ngeal thiamna tuatuamte le tuate sia khamh, ngunn, le taaute taw vawt theina ka pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Suangmanpha atna, thing ngelhna; le a dang thiamneal tuatuamte sep thiamna zongh ka pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama taw naseam khawm tu in Dan minam sung pan Ahisamach ii tapa Oholiab zongh ka teal zo hi. Vawt tu in kong thupiak theampo a vawt thei natu in a dang khutthiamte zongh thiamna nasia tak ka pia zo hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a vawt tute sia ka ompuina Puanbuk, Thuciamna Thingkuang le a sitna, Puanbuk sung vanh theampo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />sabuai le a vanhte, khamh ciitak taw kivawt meikhuam le a vanh theampo, ngimnamtui hal natu biaknatau,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />meihal piak natu biaknatau le a na zak theampo, khut silna kuang le a ngakna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate ii thiampi a sep ciang a silh tu thiampi puan manphate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />noi sathau le Mun Thiangtho ah zak tu ngimnamtuite ahi hi. Hi teng a vawt ciang, na tungah kong thupiak bang tatakin amate in vawt tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mite tungah a son tu in, “Ka tawlngak ni ahi Sabbath na tang vun, banghang ziam cile tua ni sia hong pai tu hun theampo sung Keima, Topa in note keima mi in kong vawt hunlam a kilangh natu in keima le note kilaklaw ah lim khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tawlngakna ni sia na tan kul tu hi, banghang ziam cile tua ni sia thiangtho hi. Khat po in tua ni tang ngawlin na a seam le, kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni luk sung nasep tu hun na nei uh a, ahizong ni sali ni sia a ciliap huai tawlngak ni, keima atu in a kikoituam ni ahi hi. Khat po in tua ni in na a seam le, kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mite in tua ni sia thuciamna lim khatin tang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua thu in keima le Israel mite kilaklaw ah a kip tawntung lim ahi hi, banghang ziam cile Keima, Topa in vantung le leitung ni luk sung ka vawt a, ni sali ni in na seam ngawlin ka tawlnga hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sinai Mual tungah Pathian in Moses a paupui zawkciang, Pathian ama tatak ii thupiak teng a tungah a at sa suangpheakte nii sia Moses pia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses mual tungah ngei hialma om in hong tuaksuk ngawl sia mipite in a mu ciang Aaron kungah kikhawmin ama tungah, “Egypt pan lam hong pui Moses hisia pa bang tat ziam ih he bua hi; tua ahikom eite lam hong pui tu in pathian khat hong vawtsak ta'n,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aaron in amate tungah, “Na zite, na tapate le na tanute ii a baa khamh bilbaate suutin kei kungah hong paipui tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang mi theampo in a khamh bilbaate suutin Aaron kungah paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aaron in tua bilbaate la in tuisak a, khui milim vawtna sungah sung in khamh khuitalno khat vawt hi. Mipite in, “Israel awng, hisia in Egypt pan hong pusuapui ih pathian ahi hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Aaron in khamh khuital mai ah biaknatau khat vawtin, “Zing ciangin Topa patoaina in poai kikhaam tu hi,” ci in taangko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A zing ciang zingtuungin amate in nganhing pawlkhat sangaw meihal biakpiak natu le a dangte sia kipawlkhop biakpiakna ah neak tu in hong paipui uh hi. Tua poai ah mite tokhawm in etlawm ngawl za dongin neakna dawnna le numei le pa paktatna suaksak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Manlang in ciasuk ta'n, banghang ziam cile Egypt pan na paipui na mite khialin kei hong nial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zui tu in ka thupiak lampi pan pial zo hi; khamh khuital vawtin bia uh a, sangaw biakpiakna pia zo uh hi. Amate in hisia Egypt pan a pusua pui amate ii pathian hi ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi mihingte thinpuizia ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu in, kei hong tho tu hanciam heak in. Amate tungah ka thin uuk a, ka mongsak tu hi. Tua zawkciang nangma le na suan na paalte minam lian khatin kong vawt tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahizong Moses in Topa a Pathian tungah hesuak ngenin, “ Topa awng, na thahatna le na vaangletna taw Egypt pan na suatak, na mite tungah banghangin na thin uuksak mama thong ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mite mual tungah that in a mot nop manin, nangma in Egypt pan pusua pui hi banghang Egypt te in ci theisak tu ni ziam? Na thin uuk thaisak in; na ngaisutna kheal in a, na mite tungah tuasiatna tungsak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na naseamte ahi, Abraham, Isaac le Jacob phawk in. Amate tungah ciliap huai takin na kamciam ahi, a suan a paalte van ah aksi za in tam tu a, a suan a paalte in na khapsa ngam theampo a tawntungin amate ii neisa hi tu hi, na ci thute phawk in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Topa in a ngaisutna khealin, a mite tungah a tawn bangin tuasiatna tungsak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mualtung pan Moses tuaksuk a, thupiakte a mai lang le lang ah a ki at suangpheakte nii toai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi suangpheakte Pathian vawt hi a, a tungah thupiakte ama mama ii khet sa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mipite auna Joshua in za a, Moses tungah, “Ngiaphual sungah ngal kisimna aw ka za hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Moses in, “Tua aw sia ngalzawna aw le hi ngawl, ngallelna aw zongh hi ngawl a; tua sia lasakna aw hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Moses ngiaphual nai ah hong pai in khuital milim le mihingte lap a mu ciang a thinso hi. Tualai mualpeang ah, a toai suangpheakte nii lei denna nei in tamhthamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moses in amate vawt khuital no la in, tuisak a, ngoaivui in tui taw hel hi. Tua zawkciang ama in tua tui Israel mite nesak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in Aaron munah, “Amate in tuabang a cizathuai mawna na vawtsak natu in nang bang hong law ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aaron in, “Kei tungah hong thin uuk heak in; hi mihingte ii siatna a vawt nop hamtang sia he ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in kei tungah, ‘Egypt pan hong pusuapui hi mipa Moses bang tat ziam, ih he bua hi; tua ahiciang kote hong lampui tu in pathian khat hong vawtsak ta'n, hong ci uh hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate ii kizepna manpha khamhte hong paipui natu in ka sawl a, a nei peuma in suutin kei hong pia uh hi. Tua a manpha kizepnate mei sungah ka vawk a, khuitalno milim suak hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aaron in a mite uk zawk pang ngawl a omsak sia le, a ngalte mai ah a mawmaw bangin a omsakna thu Moses in mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Moses in ngiaphual kongpi ah dingin au a, “ Topa sangah a pang peuma hi lai ah hong pai tavun!” ci hi. Tuasia ciang Levi mite theampo ama kungah kikhawm uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Moses in amate tungah, “Israel te Topa Pathian in na namsau tek taw hi ngiaphual kongpi pan a langkhat dong pai in, na suapuite, na ngualtamhte le na innpaamte thatlum tu in note theampo hong sawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Levi mite in a thu ni a, tua ni in mihing tulthum bang thatlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in Levi te tungah, “ Topa ii nasepna sungah thiampite a seam tu in na tapate, na suapuite na thalupna uh taw in noma tek tuni in kipumpiak zo na hi uh kom, Topa in note a thupha hong pia zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A zing ciang Moses in mipite tungah, “A cizathuai mawna khat vawt zo nu hi. Ahizong tu in mualtung Topa kungah ka na paito kik tu a; note mawmai natu nga thei tha tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa kungah Moses heakkik in, “Hi mite in a cizathuai mawna vawt zo hi. Amate in khamh taw pathian khat vawt in bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nong hesuakna in a mawna maisak in; ahizong na maisak zo buatu le, na mite min na khumna laibu sung pan ka min hong phiat ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka tungah mawna a neite bek ka laibu sung pan a min ka phiat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tu in pai in kong sonna munah mihingte paipui in. Ka vantunglalang in lam hong lak tu phawkin a, ahizong a hun a cin ciang hi mihingte a mawna daan ka pia tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Topa in mite tungah natna tungsak hi, banghang ziam cile amate in Aaron khamh khuitalno milim a vawtsak hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Nangma le Egypt pan na pusuapui mite in hi mun nusia in, Abraham, Isaac, Jacob le a suan a paalte tungah piak tu a, ka kamciamna munah pai tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vantunglalang khat note lam hong lak tu in kong puak tu a, Canaan te, Amor te, Hit te, Periz te, Hiv te le Jebus te ka notkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note ngampha le ngamnuam ah pai tu nu hi. Ahizong kei note taw kong pai buatu hi, banghang ziam cile mihing thinpuite na hi uh a, lampi ah kong mon tha tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi thu mite in a zaak uh ciang amate khuangai in, suangmanpha kizepna te bun nawn ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate tungah Moses ii a son natu in Topa in, “Note sia mihing thinpuite hi nu hi. Note taw tawmveino sung ih kithawl bek zong kong mon tha tu hi. Tu in na suangmanpha kizepnate suut vun, tuaciang note tungah ka sep tu sia ka khensat tu hi,” ci in a thupiak hang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Sinai Mual a nusiat zawkciang, Israel mite in suangmanpha kizepnate bun nawn ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mihingte ii ngiaphual a saat simin Moses in a Puanbuk thiangtho la in ngiaphual pan a khuala thithim na munah koi hi. Tua in Topa ii ompuina Puanbuk kici a, Topa thu a dongh nuamte in tua munah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualai ah Moses a pai simin, mipite a Puanbuk kongbiang ah ding tek a, Moses a sungtan dong en uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A sungah Moses a tum zawkciang, meeikhuam tuaksuk in Puanbuk kongbiang ah tawlnga a, Topa in meei sung pan Moses paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mipite in Puanbuk kongbiang ah meeikhuam a mu po ciang kun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngualtamh khat thuson tu bang keakin maitang kisi a Topa in Moses paupui hi. Tuaciang Moses ngiaphual ah heak kik hi. Ahizong Nun ii tapa, ama a hu, tangvalpa Joshua sia Puanbuk sungah om lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moses in Topa tungah, “Tua ngam ah hi mihingte lampui tu in nong sawlna thu thumaan ahi hi, ahizong kei taw a paikhawm tu sia nong son bua hi. Nangma in kei, nong telthiang a, dik kong sa hi nong ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu in tuabang na hile, na tupnate hong son ta'n, tua hile nangma na seamin, kong lungkimsak tawntung tu hi. Hi minam nangma atu in na tealsa a hina thu zongh phawk in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in, “Nang taw ka paikhawm tu a, zawna kong pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses in, “Kote taw nong paikhawm bua ahile, hi mun hong nusiasak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kote nong tonpui bua ahile, keima le na mite tungah na lungkimna thu akua in bangbangin hong he tu ziam? Kote nong ompuina in leitung midangte sung pan kote hong kilamdangsak tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Nong nget sa bangin kong seam tu hi, banghang ziam cile nang kong tel sitset a, na tungah ka lungkim hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Moses in, “Hesuakna taw nong ompuina khuavak taang velvol sia hong musak ta'n,” ci in ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in, “Note mai ah, ka phatna teng kong paipui tu a, noma omna ah ka min thiangtho kong thangsak tu hi. Keima in Topa ka hi a, mulkimna le hesuakna ka teal mite tungah ka lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka maitang kong musak buatu hi, banghang ziam cile ka maitang a mu peuma, nungta ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahizong suang khat tungah na din thei natu in, ka kungah mun khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kong ompuina khuavak taang velvol sia in nang hong kaantan ciang, suanghawng sungah nang kong koi tu a, kong kaantan zawk mateng ka khut taw nang kong hum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ka khut ka dok tu a, ka nung teng na mu tu hi, ahizong ka mai na mu buatu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “A masate taw kibangin suangpheak nii vawt in a, na tapsak suangpheak masate tungah kammal teng tuate nii tungah ka at tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kithoai in a, Sinai Mualdawn ah kei taw kimu tu in zingsang ciang hong paito ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khat zongh kaato pui heak in a; mual tung koima ah kuama omsak heak in; tuu ahizong, khui ahizong, mualpeang ah tha heak in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in suangpheak nii vawt a, Topa thupiak bang tatakin a zing ciang zingtuung in Sinai Mual tungah puato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Meeilom khat sungah Topa hong tuaksuk a, tualai ah ama taw ding khawmin, Topa ci in a min thiangtho thangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in Moses mai kaantan a, tuaciang ama samin, “Keima in mulkimna le hesuakna taw a kidim Topa Pathian khat ka hi hi, ka thin uuk hakin, itna lian le thumaanna a lakpa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka kamciamte khang tul tam mama te tungah ka len a, siatna le mawna ka maisak hi; ahizong a pate a nute mawnate hangin tate le tute tungah, khang thum khang li dongin daan ka pia tu hi,” ci in pualaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moses in lei ah manlang tak kunsuk in bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in, “ Topa awng, kei tungah nong lungkim takpi ahile kote taw hong paikhawm ta'n. Hi mihingte thinpui hi, ahizong kote siatna le mawna hong maisak ta'n a, nangma aituam mihing in hong saang ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Tu in Israel mite taw thuciamna khat ka vawt hi. Hi leitung minamte sungah a kivawt ngeingawl na thupite amate mai ah ka vawt tu hi. Keima, Topa ii na thupi ka vawt theinate mihing theampo in hong mu tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile note atu in nalamdang khat ka vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuni in kong piak thukhamte zui vun. Note maisang na manaw uh ciangin Amor te, Canaan te, Hit te, Periz te, Hiv te le Jebus te ka notkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na thetna ngam ah a teang mihingte taw thukimna khote vawt heak vun, banghang ziam cile tuasia in note atu in thi theina thaang suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua luangin a biaknataute baltham in, a khuam thiangthote lalcipsakin numeipathian Asherah milimte saattan vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Pathian dang bia heak vun, banghang ziam cile Keima, Topa in kidempui dang ka dei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ngammite taw thukimna khote bangma vawt heak vun, banghang ziam cile doai biate ii pathiante tungah sangaw biakpiakna a nei ciang, pathian biakpiakna an ne tu in hong sam tu a, note hong ze et tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na tapate in tua ngamdang numeite teenpui tha tu a, amate in kei tungah a thumaan ngawl natu le a doai pathiante a biak natu in na tapate lam khialpui tha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Thik taw kivawt pathiante vawtin bia heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tol saw ngawl Anluum Poaipi vawt suak vun. Kong thupiak bangin, Abib tha ni sali sung tol saw ngawl anluum ne vun, banghang ziam cile tua tha in Egypt pan pusuak nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tapa suakciil le inn nganhing no suakciil a pa theampo keima aa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahizong laa a suakciil pawpo sia a taangin tuu khat pia in lei kik tu nu hi. Na lei kik bua uh ahile a ngawng thiaktan vun. Tapaciil peuma lei kik vun. Biakpiakna khat a keng ngawl peuma ka mai ah hong kilaak heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ni luk sung noma na sep tu hun na nei uh a, ahizong lothaw hun le anlaak hun ngawngawn in ni sali ni in naseam heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na mangtaang anpal na laak kipat ciang Anlaak Poaipi khaamin, tangngam sung thingnga na kaikhop ciang Buk Poaipi khaam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kum khatin thumvei, Keima Topa Israel te ii Pathian bia tu in na mi, pasal a minpiang nong pai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Note mai ah minamte notkeak in, na ngam kong keaksak zawkciang, poai khaam thumvei hun sung teng kuama in na ngam hong zaw tu hanciam ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nganhing taw biakpiakna nong nei uh ciang tol saw anluum hong pia heak vun. Paisan Poaipi hunsung na ngaw uh nganhing sa peuma a zingsang ciang dong koi heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kum simin na laak anpal sia Topa inn sungah hong paipui tavun. Tuuno ahizong kealno ahizong a pui noaitui sungah huan heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah, “Hi kammalte at in, banghang ziam cile nangma le Israel mite tungah thuciamna ka vawt sia, hi kammalte kibulphu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualai ah Moses an le tui ne ngawlin, sun sawmli le zan sawmli sung Topa taw omkhawm hi. Moses in Thupiak Sawmte ahi- thuciamna kammalte suangpheak tungah at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in Thupiak Sawmte toai in, Sinai Mual pan hong tuaksuk ciang Topa taw kipaupui ahikom a maitang taang hi; ahihang ama in a taan hunlam he ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aaron le mihingte theampo in Moses maitang taang a mu ciang lau in neak ngam ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahizong Moses in amate sam a, Aaron le taangpi lampuite theampo ama kungah pai in Moses in paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Israel mite theampo ama kungah kikhawm in, Topa ii Sinai Mual ah a piak thukham theampo Moses in amate tungah pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Moses in thuson a man zawkciang dial khat taw a mai seal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa paupui tu in Topa ompuina Puanbuk sungah Moses a pai simin, a dial hawk hi. Hong pusua ciang son tu in, a thupiak theampo Israel mite tungah son a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />amate in a maitang taang sia mu uh hi. Tuaciang Topa paupui tu in a pai kik dong dial taw a mai seal hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in Israel taangpi taangta bup kaikhawm in amate tungah, “Hi thu sia na ngamtat natu uh Topa thupiak ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ni luk sung noma na, na seam tu uh a, ahizong ni sali ni sia ni thiangtho hi tu a, keima, na Topa atu a kikoituam, a ciliaphuai tawlngak ni hi tu hi. Tua ni in na a seam peuma kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sabbath ni in na inn uh ah mei ngawngawn thut ngawl tu nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses in Israel mite theampo tungah, “Hisia Topa thupiak ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa tungah piakkhiat khat nei vun. A pia nuam peuma in, khamh, ngunn, taau;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />puan neal; vancii, a sandup le a san samul puan; kealmul taw a kivawt puan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a san kinimh tuutal vun; savun neal; acacia thing;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />meidet sathau; noi sathau atu le ngimnamtui atu hel namtuite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ephod le Thiampi Lianbel ii awmdal ah bul tu suangmanpha san le a dang suangmanphate paipui tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Note sung pan thiamna nei naseam mi theampo hong pai in Topa thupiak theampo vawt hen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puanbuk, a sitna le a puasang sitna, a vanh khaina koaite le a kalte, a zawlte, a khuamte le a tawdapte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuciamna Thingkuang, a puakna thingpumte, a sitna le a dalna puankhai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />sabuai, a puakna thingpumte le a vanh theampo; Pathian a piak anluum;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />meidet natu meikhuam le a vanhte, meiinnte le meidet sathau,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ngimnamtui halna tu biaknatau le a puakna thingpumte; noi sathau; ngimnamtui; Puanbuk kongbiang puankhai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />meihal biakpiak natu biaknatau le a saaksai, a zawnna thingpumte le a vanh teng; kisilna kuang le a ngakna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a doituam atu puankhaite, a khuamte le a tawdapte; a doituam tumna kongbiang puankhai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Puanbuk le doituam atu khetphinte le khaute;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciang Thiangtho Mun ah thiampite in na a sep ciang a silh tu a tuanngen, a et hoi puante — thiampi Aaron le a tapate atu puan thiangthote a vawt tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel mite theampo cia siat a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuaciang Topa ii ompuina Puanbuk a vawt nuam peuma in Topa tungah piakkhiatna khat keng tek hi. Amate in biakna tu in a kisamh le thiampi puante vawt natu in a kisamh vanhte theampo hong paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Piak nopna thin a nei numei le pasal te in kizepna phinte, bilbaate, khutzungbute, khite le khamh suang manpha namcinte paipui in, Topa tungah aap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Puan neal; vancii, a sandup, a san samul puan; kealmul puan; a san a kinimh tuutal ii vun; ahibuale savun neal paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ngunn ahizong, taau ahizong a pia theite in Topa atu in pia tek a, nasep natu khat pawpo ah a kizangh thei tu acacia thing a nei peuma in hong paipui tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thiamneal vawt thei numei theampo in amate vawtsa puan neal, khau le samul khau vancii, a sandup le a sante hong paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in kealmul taw khauzam zongh vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A lampuite in ephod le awmdal ah a bul tu in suangmanpha san le a dang suangmanpha te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tuaciang meidet sathau, noi sathau le a ngimnamtuite atu in hel namtuite le sathau hong paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah nasep tu a thupiak bangin, a pia nuam Israel mite theampo in Topa tungah a piakkhiatna tek hong paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Moses in Israel te tungah, “Judah minam sung pan Hur ii tupa ahi, Uri ii tapa Bezalel Topa in teal zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa in Bezalel sia ama ii vaangletna taw kidimsakin, khutthiamna, hi theina, le thiamneal nasep tuatuamte heaktheina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />pungsaan ngeal thiamna tuatuamte le tua teng khamh, ngunn, le taaute taw vawt theina;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />kizepna suangmanpha tat thiamna; thingngel thiamna le thiamneal nasep tuatuamte pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa in ama, Bezalel le Dan minam sung pan Ahisamach ii tapa Oholiab tungah midangte khutthiamna a hil tu in pilna pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa in amate tungah khutthiamte, a ngeal thiamte, le thiamtak thiamte, vancii, a dup au le a san tuumul le a dang puante theampo sep thiamna pia zo hi. Amate in nasep namkim seam thei in, a ngeal thiamte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Bezalel, Oholiab, le Puanbuk thianthosak natu a kisamh theampo vawt tu zia a he te, Topa ii thiamna le heaktheina a piak khutthiam dangte theampo in Topa thupiak bang linlianin na theampo seam tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses in Bazalel, Oholiab le Topa ii hi theina a piak khutthiamna a nei midangte le nasep a hu nuamte sam a, nasep kipan tu in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in Israel te ii Puanbuk thianthosak natu in a paipui piakkhiatna theampo Moses tung pan nga siat hi. Ahihang Israel mite in a piaksate zing simin Moses tungah pia tawntung lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zawkciang khutthiamna nei tua nasep a seam mite pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses tungah, “ Topa ii hong thupiak nasepna atu in a kisamh za sang a tamzaw vanh, mihingte in hong paipui uh hi,” ci in zasak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, Moses in ngiaphual tengah Puanbuk thiangtho atu in kuama ii a piak thua ngawl natu thupia hi; tuasia ciang, mihingte in pia nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hong paipui sa teng, nasep theampo zaw natu in kicing vaal liang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Naseamte sung pan khutthiambel teng in Topa ii ompuina Puanbuk vawt uh hi. Amate in tua puanbuk sia vancii, a sandup, le a san samul taw a kitak cherub limte taw thiamngel puanneal bek 10 taw vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua puante a letna kibangin, metre 12 sau in, metre 2 beak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in puandal nga teng khuikhawmin, a dang nga teng zongh a kibangin khuikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in tua puante nii puasang mong tengah vanci puan taw bilvangte vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puan khat tungah bilvang sawmnga vawtin, a khat sia tung zongh ah sawmnga ma vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in tua puante nii a pe natu in khamh kual sawmnga vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang amate in Puanbuk sitna tu in kealmul taw kivawt puan sawm le khat vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua puante kikimsak siatin, metre 13 sau in, metre 2 beak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in tua puante nga ciang khatin khuikhawmin, a dang luk teng khatin khuikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in tua puante a khakbel sia mong ah bilvang sawmnga vawt uh a, a dang khat sia tungah bilvang sawmnga ma vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A sitna sa khat a suak tu in tua puante nii a pe natu in amate in taaukual sawmnga vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puanbuk sitna tu in amate in a san taw a kinimh tuutal ii vun taw a kivawt khat le savun neal taw a kivawt a puasang sitna khat, a sitna nii vawt thua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in Puanbuk a kalpheak tu in acacia thing zangh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A mungte metre li saangin, centimetre 66 beak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />a kalte khat le khat a kipee natu in a meang nii neisak hi. A kalpheakte tuabangin kivawt siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in thang sang atu a kalpheak kul,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />a meangte khat le khat a kipee natu in khat ii nuai ah ngunn tawdap nii veu, ngunn tawdap sawmli vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Puanbuk saksang atu a kalpheak kul,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />a mung khat ii nuai ah ngunn tawdap nii veu, ngunn tawdap 40 vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Puanbuk nitumna nungsang atu in a kalpheak luk
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />a kingte ah a kalpheak nii vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A king ah a kalpheakte a bul pan pee in a dawn dongin kizomsak hi. Tua king nii a piangsak a kalpheakte nii sia tuabang ma in kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuabangin a kalpheak liat om in, mung khat ciang tawdap nii tek ngunn tawdap sawm le luk om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate in acacia thingzawl sawm le nga, puanbuk a kalpheakte atu in pangh khat ah zawl nga veu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />a langkhat ah a kalpheak nga le a nungsang nitumna sangah a kalpheak nga vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A kalpheakte ii lang khenna san pan a kithung zawlsau sia puanbuk mong khat pan mong khat dong a tuantung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate in a kalpheakte khamh taw tuamin, khamh taw ma a kituam a zawlte a len tu in khamh kualte thua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amate in vancii, a sandup le samul san taw a kitak cherubim lim taw thiamngel puanneal puankhai khat vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate in puankhai khat khak natu in khamh taw a kizut, khamh koai taw a kithua acacia thing khuam li vawt uh hi. Tuaciang khuamte a len tu in ngunn tawdap li vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate in Puanbuk tumna kongbiang tu in vancii puan neal, a sandup le a san samul taw a kitak, thiamngel taw a zep puankhai khat vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua puankhai atu amate in a koaite taw a kithua, a dawn teng le a ciangte khamh taw a kituam khuam nga vawtin, tua khuamte atu in taau tawdap nga vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bezalel in a sau centimetre 110, a zai centimetre 66 le a saang centimetre 66 a pha Thuciamna Thingkuang sia acacia thing taw vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in khamh ciitak taw a sung a pua tuamin, a kiil kiimkot teng khamh taw zial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua thingkuang puak natu in ama in khamh kual li vawtin, a lang ah kual nii veve khuam peang li tungah bul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in a puak natu in acacia thingpumte vawt a, khamh taw tuamin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />kuang pangh ah a kibul a kualte sungah thun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a sitna sia a sau centimetre 110, a zai centimetre 66 in khamh ciitak taw vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in sek taw a kiseak khamh taw cherub niite lim vawtin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a sitna mong ah khat veu koi hi. Ama in a sitna taw sakhat suak tu in vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cherub te thingkuang sitna tungah khat le khat kimai ngatin a tha phalh a, kuang sitna liap siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in a sauna centimetre 88, a zaina centimetre 44, le a saanna centimetre 66 a pha sabuai sia acacia thing taw vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in tuasia khamh ciitak taw tuamin, a king kiimkot teng khamh taw zial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kiimkot millimetre 75 zai a mong tuamna vawt a, khamh taw zuut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in tua sabuai zawnna tu in khamh kual li vawtin, a peang omna king li teng ah bul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kualte sabuai zawnna thingpumte thun natu ahikom a mong tuamna taw a kinaina ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A zawnna thingpumte acacia thing hi a, khamh taw tuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in sabuai atu a vawt khamh taw kivawt kuangte: pakante, haite, haitungte, le bealte sia sapittui taw biakpiakna in zak tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in khamh ciitak taw meikhuam vawt hi. A bul le a khuam sia a kiseak khamh taw vawtin, a zepna paakte, a mom le a paakpalhte zongh a khuam taw kisakhat siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pangh pan baak luk zaamsakin, a lang le a lang ah baak thum veve om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Baak luk te khat simin almond paakmom le a paakpalhte taw a kibang a zepna paakte thum tek nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua meikhuam in almond paakmom le a paakpalh taw a kibang a zepna paakte li nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A baak kop thum sim ii nuai ah a mom khat tek om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Paakmomte, a baakte le meikhuam sia a kiseak khamh bekno khat bekma taw a kivawt sakhat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in meikhuam atu in meiinn sali vawtin, khamh ciitak taw taitee le kuangdaite vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in meikhuam le a vanh teng khamh ciitak kilogramme 35 taw vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in ngimnamtui hal natu in acacia thing taw biaknatau khat vawt hi. Tua in a dung a vai a kikim hi a, a sauna centimetre 45, a zaina centimetre 45 le a saanna centimetre 90 ahi hi. A kingdok li teng kipee siatin, sakhat suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in a tung, a pangh li teng, le a kingdok teng khamh ciitak taw tuamin, a kiil kiimkot teng khamh taw zial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in a zawnna thingpumte thun natu in khamh kual nii vawt a, a pangh nii ii kiil nuai ah bul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in acacia thingpumte vawtin, khamh taw tuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in paaknamtui bangin a kihel a thiangtho noi sathau le ngimnamtui ciitak zongh vawt hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama in meihal biakpiak natu in acacia thing taw biaknatau khat vawt hi. Tua in a dung a vai a kikim hi a, a sauna metre 2.2 le a zaina metre 2.2 le a saanna metre 1.3 ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Biaknatau taw sakhat a suak tu in ama in a king li te dawn doksak hi. Ama in tua a dokte taau taw tuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Biaknatau ah vanh zak tu in bealte, keaute, kuangte, a koaite le vut luana kuangte zongh vawt hi. Hi vanh teng theampo taau taw vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in taau saaksai khat vawtin biaknatau saanna a lang bansuk in biaknatau ii ngong nuai ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in zawn natu kual li vawtin a kingte li ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in acacia thing taw zawnna thingpumte vawtin, taau taw tuam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />biaknatau lang le lang ah a om kualte sungah thun hi. Biaknatau sia thingpheak taw vawtin a sung hawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Topa ii ompuina Puanbuk tumna kongbiang ah naseam numeite neisa limlanghte taw taau kuang le taau tawdap vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in puanneal puankhaite taw Topa ompuina puanbuk atu doituam vawt hi. A thangsang pangh doina puankhaite sia metre 44 sau a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua puankhaite sia ngunn taw kivawt puankhaina koaite le a ciangte taw taau tawdap kul a nei taau khuam kul tungah kikhak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A saksang pangh doina zongh tuabang ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nitumna sang a pangh doina puankhaite sia metre 22 sau in, ngunn taw a kivawt puankhaina koaite le a ciangte taw ngunn tawdap sawm a nei khuam sawm tungah kikhak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kongbiang omna nisuana sang teng doina sia metre 22 ma zai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kongbiang langkhat veve puankhaite metre 6.6 veu zai a, tawdap thum a nei khuam thum tungah kikhak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Doituam kiimkot puankhai theampo puanneal phate taw kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuam tawdapte taau taw kivawtin, vanh khaina koaite, ciangzawlte le khuam tung sitnate ngunn taw kivawt hi. Doituam kiimkot khuam theampo ngunn ciangzawlte taw kizom siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Doituam tumna kongbiang puankhai sia vancii, a sandup le a san samul taw a kitak, thiamngel in a kizeam puanneal puan pha taw kivawt hi. Tua puankhai sia doituam ii puankhaite bangma in metre 9 sau a, metre 2 saang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua puankhai sia taau tawdap li a nei khuam lite tungah kikhak hi. Puan khaina koaite, a dawn tuamnate le a ciangzawlte ngunn taw kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Puanbuk le doituam kiimkot letna khetphin theampo taau taw kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thupiak sawmte a ki atna suangpheak niite koina ahi, Topa ii ompuina Puanbuk sungah na zakte a nuai a bang ahi hi. Tua tepteena lai vawt tu Moses in sawl a, thiampi Aaron ii tapa Ithamar khutnuai a naseam Levi mite in vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judah minam sung pan Hur ii tupa, Uri ii tapa Bezalel in Topa ii thupiak bangin seam siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama a hupa Dan minam sung pan Ahisamach ii tapa Oholiab sia suang tung laikhen thiam, a ngeal thiam, le vancii, a sandup, a san samul puan le puanneal pha a tak thiam khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A thiangtho puanbuk atu Topa tungah a ki aap khamh teng a kizangh ngei khaikhin taw a kitee ciang kilogramme tul khat ngit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Misimna bangin a kipia ngunn teng a kizangh ngei khaikhin taw a kitee ciang kilogramme 3,430 ngit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hite sia mihing kisim lai in mi sim ii 22 a piak teng kingawm in biakinn khaikhin taw a kitee ahi hi. Kum kul pan a tungsia teng a kisim ciang a vekpi mi 603,550 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ngunnte sung pan kilogramme 3,400 teng a thiangtho Puanbuk le puankhai atu tawdap zakhat te vawt natu in kizangh a, tawdap khat ciang kilogramme 34 veu kizangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bezalel in, a taanglai ngunn kilogramme 30 taw a ciangzawlte, a khuamte tungah vanh khaina koaite le a dawn tuamnate vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa tungah a ki aap taau theampo kilogramme 2,425 ngit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in tua taaute taw Topa ompuina Puanbuk tumna kongbiang tawdapte, taau saaksai a nei biaknatau, biaknatau atu vanh theampo vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Doituam kiim le a tumna kongbiang tawdapte le Puanbuk le doituam kiimkot letna in a kizangh khetphin theampo ama in taau taw vawt hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A Thiangtho Mun ah thiampite na a sep ciang a silh tu in vancii, a sandup le samul san taw a tuanngen puansilhte vawt uh hi. Moses tungah a thupiak bangin amate in Aaron atu in thiampi puante vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ephod sia puanneal; vancii, a sandup le a san samulpuan le khamh khauzam taw vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in khamh dalte seakin, a paa in zen a, puanneal phate le vancii, a sandup le a san samulpuante taw khui khawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in a sawm natu liangkhai nii vawt a, ephod a kho thei natu in a pangh ah khii hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah a thupiak bangin a vanhzak kibang, pha takin a kitak kawngkhau sia ephod taw sakhat tu in, a tungah khii hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in carnelian suangsante taatin khamh dapphate tungah suang hi; tuate tungah Jacob tapa sawm le niite min teng suanglai khen thiamte in khensak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah a thupiak bang tatakin Israel minam sawm le niite taang tu in, amate in tua suangsante ephod liangkhai puan tungah suang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in thiamngelna le ephod vawtna in a kizangh vanhte taw ma in awmdal vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua in a kikim king li nei in thuap nii in kithep a, centimetre 22 sau, centimetre 22 zai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in tua awmdal tungah suangmanpha ngual li in suang a, ngual khatna ah ruby, topaz le garnet;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ngual niina ah emerald, sapphire le diamond;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ngual thumna ah turquoise, agate, le amethyst;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />le ngual lina ah beryl, carnelian le jasper te ahi hi. Tua suangte khamh dapphate tungah suang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel minam sawm le niite taang tu in, suang sawm le niite tungah Jacob tapa sawm le niite khat tek ii min khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Awmdal atu in khauhualte bangin a kipheak khamh ciitak khi nguite vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in khamh dappha nii le khamh kual nii vawtin, khamh kual niite awmdal a tungsang king veve ah belh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in khamh khau niite sia kual niite tungah khit a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a dappha niite tungah a mong niite khit hi, tuabangin ephod liangkhai puan mai sangah tuate belh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in khamh kual nii vawtin, ephod zawkciang sungsang awmdal ii nuaisang mongte nii ah belh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in khamh kual nii vawt thua in, ephod liangkhai puante nii ii nuai, a maisang a kipeena kungah pha takin a kitak kawngkhau tung san ah belh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah a thupiak bang tatakin kawngkhau tungah awmdal sia a kawm ngawl natu in amate in awmdal kualte ephod kualte tungah vancii khau taw sawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in ephod nuai ah a kisilh puantual sia vancii samul khau ngitnget taw tak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lu thun natu in a vang sia a ek ngawl natu in puan kitak sa taw kikhui thua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah a thupiak bang tatakin puantual mong nuai sang kiim tengah amate in puanneal pha taw a kivawt le vancii, a sandup le a san samul puan taw kivawt talee ngate, khamh ciitak taw a kivawt tengeng te taw kithatheak in koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa ii Moses tungah a thupiak bang tatakin amate in Aaron le a tapate atu in laktong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />dial, lukhu, puanneal ngoaipuan tom le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />puanneal, vancii, a sandup le a san samul taw a kivawt thiamngel in a kizeam kawngkhau vawtsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate in khamh ciitak taw Topa tungah ki aapna lim lakna thiangtho a hi, kizepna vawtin tua tungah, “ Topa atu Kitavaw” ci in khen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa ii Moses tungah a thupiak bang tatakin amate in tua kizepna sia dial mai sangah vancii khau khat taw khii uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Topa ompuina Puanbuk nasep theampo kizo siat zo hi. Topa ii Moses tungah a thupiak bang tatakin Israel mite in na theampo seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate in Moses kungah Puanbuk le a vanh theampo, a vanh khaina koaite, a kalte, a zawlliang a tuukpite, a khuamte le a tawdapte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />a sanin a kinimh tuuvun taw a kivawt a sitna; savun ciitak taw a kivawt a sitna; puankhai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />suangpheakte a kikoina Thuciamna Thingkuang, a thingpumte le a sitna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />sabuai le a vanhte theampo, Pathian a piak anluum;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />khamh ciitak meikhuam, a meiinnte, a vanhzak theampo le meidet sathau;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />khamh biaknatau; noi sathau; ngimnamtui; Puanbuk kongbiang puankhai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />taau saaksai taw kithua biaknatau, a thingpumte, a vanhzak theampo; khut silna kuang le a ngakna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />doituam atu puankhaite, a khuamte le a tawdapte; kongbiang puankhai le a khaute; Puanbuk khetphinte; puanbuk sungah a kizangh tu vanhzak theampo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />tuaciang a Thiangtho Mun ah thiampite silh tu puansilh tuanngente — thiampi Aaron le a tapate atu in puan thiangthote hong paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Topa ii Moses tungah a thupiak bang tatakin Israel mite in nasep theampo seam siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Moses in a nasepna teng sit siat a, Topa thupiak bangin a sep siatna thu mu hi. Tua ahiciang Moses in amate thupha pia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tha masa, a ni khat ni in Topa ii ompuina Puanbuk sia lemh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thupiak Sawmte koina Thuciamna Thingkuang tua buk sungah koi in, a mai ah puankhai khai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A sungah sabuai tumpui in a tungah vanhte koi in. Meikhuam zongh la in a, meivakte bul in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuciamna Thingkuang mai ah ngimnamtui hal natu in khamh biaknatau koi in a, Puanbuk kongbiang ah puankhai khai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puanbuk mai ah meihal biakpiak natu in biaknatau koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Puanbuk le biaknatau kilaklaw ah khut silna kuang koi in a, tui dim in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A doituam kiimkot puan taw uumin a kongbiang ah puankhai khai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tuaciang Puanbuk le a vanhzak theampo a thiangtho sathau noina taw aap in, tua hile thiangtho tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua zawkciang biaknatau le a vanhte theampo a thiangtho sathau noina taw aap in, tua hile thiangtho sinsen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ta bangma in khut silna kuang le a ngakna zongh aap in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Aaron le a tapate puanbuk kongbiang ah paipui in a, a zeksa kibualna neisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aaron in keima na a seam thiampi a sep thei natu in thiampi puante silhsak in, sathau buakin, hi bangin ama aap in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tapate paipui in, laktong silhsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaciang thiampite bangin keima na hong sepsak thei natu in, a pa sathau na buak bangma, a tate zongh sathau buak in. Hi bang sathau buakna in amate maisang hun theampo ah thiampi suaksak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin Moses in na theampo seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Egypt pan a pusua zawk a kum niina, a tha masa, a ni khat ni in, Topa ii ompuina Puanbuk kilemh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Moses in a tawdapte pha sukin, a kalpheakte thua a, zawlliang le tuukpite thungin, a khuamte phut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in Topa thupiak bangin puanbuk tungah a sitna phalhin, a puasang tuipuan sia a tung pan khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in suangpheakte nii la in Thuciamna Thingkuang sungah koi hi. Ama in a zawnna thingpumte a bilvang sungah thun in, Thuciamna Thingkuang sitna khak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in Puanbuk sungah Thuciamna Thingkuang koi a, puankhai khak hi. Topa thupiak bangin, Moses in Thuciamna Thingkuang hi bangin seal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in Puanbuk sung saksang, puankhai pua sangah sabuai koi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin Topa a kipia anluumte, tua sabuai tungah lui hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ama in Puanbuk sung thangsang king, sabuai taw kingalsai in meivak khuam koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin tualai Topa ii ompuina ah ama in mei de hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in Puanbuk sung puankhai mai ah khamh biaknatau koi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin ngimnamtui hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in Puanbuk kongbiang ah puankhai khak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tua mun puankhai mai ah meihal biakpiak natu in biaknatau koi hi. Topa thupiak bangin tua biaknatau tungah ama in sangawna taw meihal biakpiakna le antang taw biakpiakna te seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in Puanbuk le biaknatau kilaklaw ah kisilna kuang koi in tui dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Moses, Aaron, le a tapate in tualai ah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin, Puanbuk sung le biaknatau ah a pai simin a khut le a peangte sil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Moses in Puanbuk le biaknatau kiimkot teng uumin a doituam kongbiang ah puankhai khai hi. Tuabangin ama in nasep theampo man zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuasia ciang meei in Puanbuk tuam a Topa ii ompuina khuavak taang velvol sia in tua puanbuk dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hi bang ahi hu in Puanbuk sungah Moses tum thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Puanbuk pan meei a kilapto ciang bekin Israel te in a ngiaphual mun dangah khiin uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualai ah meei a kaai laiteng a ngiaphual khiin ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Duisung ah a vathap sung tawntungin amate in Topa ii ompuina ahi, Puanbuk tungah sunin meei le zanin meikuang mu thei uh hi.
  </para>
</usx>
